<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">- POGORO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Wafalumi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha kwanja sha Wafalumi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wafalumi</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Wafa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAFALUMI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Vitabu vya Mfalumi 1 na 2 shanjiru shimu shikulu kumbiti shibagulwa wega mbili, makashu kwa visoweru vya shigiliki, shitafusiliwa handa lipatanu ligona. Imanika ndili handa gaa kavilembiti vitabu vya mfalumi 1 na 2 mlemba gwa shitabu sha mfalumi katendera vinja vivuwa kushimalila shitabu ashi. Guloli 1 mfalumi 11: 41 na 14:19 na 14:29 kwa mfanu gumu viraa tuvimana ndili shitabu ashi shilembitwi koshi ama shimalilitwi koshi, tulihola kuwera shilembitwi pa mfalumi Yehoniya pa kuleka ukulu mushinja sha 561 B.C, toziya lilawiru ali litakula mu 2 wafalumi 25: 27. Wafunda wavuwa viraa wavimaniti shipandi shikulu sha vitabu avi vilembitwi vinja vivuwa vya makashu.Vitabu vya 1 mfalumi na 2 mfalumi shiyowelera kila mfalumi gwa israeli na Yuda kulawila shaka sha mfalumi Sulemani, shaka shili isi mbili ziweriti pamuhela shitakulira ntambu ya kubaguluwa kwa Liboma lya mfalumi na kubaguluwa kwaa histori ya isi mbili mpaka kukangalwa na kukolwamlima kwa isi imonga. Walemba walola kila mfalumi na mausianu gakuyi na Mlungu na ama wafata Mlungu ama wamfata ndiri Mlungu. Wafalumi wamu wafata Mlungu ntambu yakafila. 2 mfalumi 18: 3 wamonga watenda vidoda kwa Mlungu 2 Wafalumi 21: 2 panu walema katakulira weli kwa wafalumi walii yawamwakinti Mlungu na wawona Mlungu ntambu yakawapanana mpatiru.Toziya waweliti wamjimila Mlungu mu 2 wafalumi 17:7, tufunditwi handa israeli waweliti wawingwa.Toziya Waisraeli waweliti watenda vidoda kwa Mlungu na womberi waweliti waguwira wamlungu wamonga,</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERA AMU</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi 1-11 shiyowelera ntambu gaa Dawudi kamshema Selemani kuwera mfalumi na kuyikolaniziya isi yimu ya israeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Mushipandi 12-16 tulifunditi ntambu ya mabagulagu ga maboma mawili geni ndo Israeli na Yuda na viraa na wamu wa walonguziya wawu.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 17-19 shiyowelera mawazili na mtambika Eliya na ugweka wa mfalumi Ahabu gwa Israeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi 20-22 shiyowelera upeleru wa Ahabu kuyilonguziya Israeli na wamu wa wafalumi wamonga wa Israeli na Yuda.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Lishaka lya upeleru lya Mfalumi Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Mfalumi Dawudi, shaka pakaweriti mzewi nentu, wantumintumi wakuyi wamgibikiriti mabulangeti, kumbiti ata hangu kapatiti ndiri livuki. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Wantumintumi su wamkosiya, “Mtuwa gwetu mfalumi, mbaka tukusakulili yakayalamiti kakutenderi na kakuloli weri. Kakukisikili, su kakupanani livuki.” <verse eid="1KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Shakapanu wasakulasakula mhinga kaherepa koseri isi Israeli, wampata mdala yumu kaherepa wamshema Abishagi, kulawa Shunami, wamjega kwa mfalumi. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Mdala ayu kaweriti kaherep nentu, na kanja kumtendera mfalumi na kumlolera, kumbiti kagonja nayu ndiri.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adoniya kankufira ufalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />“Shaka ashi, Adoniya mweni mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Hagiti kalikweniziyi kalonga neni hanilitendi mfalumi mweni, kalitandiliti mbutu za kukwega na wakwena farasi na watuga mbiru hamsini wakumlongolera na kumnemelera.”<verse eid="1KI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Kumbiti tati gwakuwi Dawudi, kaweriti kamkalipira ndiri mwana gwakuyi ata mala yimu na kumkosiya ntambu gaa kankutenda hangu. Viraa virii Adoniya nakaka kaniti sheni sheherepa nentu, kwa kwiwuka kaweriti kamfata Abasalomu kwa kwiwuka. <verse eid="1KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adoniya walitakuziya na Yoabu mwana gwa Seruya na mtambika Abiyatali na womberi wamfata na wajimilirana. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Kumbiti mtambika Zadoki na Beneya, mwana gwa Yehoyada na Natani na Shimei na Rei, pamuhera na walolira wa Dawudi wamjimira ndiri Adoniya.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Lishaka limu Adoniya kalaviyiti shijungu sha ng'ombi na kondolu na ng'ombi mwana yawaweriti tawi kulibuhi lya njoka, pakwegera na mbwiru yawaishema Erogeli. Kawashemera walongu wakuyi woseri, wana wa Mfalumi Dawudi na wantumintumi woseri wa mfalumi yawaweriti wa likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />Kumbiti mbuyi gwa Mlungu Natani na Beneya na walolira wa mfalumi na Selemani mlongu gwakuyi kawashemera ndiri.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani Katendwa kuwera Mfalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Shakapanu Natani kamgendera Batisheba mawu gwa Selemani, na kamkosiya, “Hashi gupikanila ndiri handa Adoniya mwana gwakuyi Hagiti, kalitenda mfalumi? Na Mfalumi gwetu Dawudi kashimana ndiri shintu! <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Handa gufira kugalopoziya makaliru gaku na ga mwana gwaku Selemani, nikugambiziya hangu,” <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />Gumgenderi Mfalumi Dawudi, gumkosiyi, hashi, mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, gunapira ndiri neni ntumintumi gwaku pagulonga, “Mwana gwaku Selemani hakaweri mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi na hakalikali pashiti shaneni sha ukulu?” Iwera hashi, vinu Adoniya kakolamlima? <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />“Na paguwera gwankali gwankuyowera na mfalumi, haningiri na kuvitakula nakaka visoweru vyaku.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Su, Batisheba kamgendera mfalumi mushumba mwakuyi. Shaka ashi mfalumi kaweriti mzeyi nentu, na yomberi Abishagi kulawa Shunami kaweriti kankumtendera. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Batisheba kang'ong'onala kamsundamalira mfalumi, na mfalumi kamkosiya, “Gufira shishi?” <verse eid="1KI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Batisheba Kamwankula, “Mtuwa gwangu, gunapiriti neni ntumintumi gwaku palongolu pa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku, pagulonga, Mwana gwaku Selemani kawera ufalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Vinu guloli Adoniya kankukolamlima, na gwenga mtuwa mfalumi guvimana ndiri shintu kuusu aga. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Kalaviya tambiku ya ng'ombi, na kondolu wavuwa na vyatawi, na kuwashema wana wa mfalumi Dawudi, na mtambika Abiyatali, na Yoabu mkulu gwa shonta, kumbiti wantumintumi wakuyi Selemani kamshemera ndiri. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Na vinu gwee mfalumi mtuwa gwangu, wantu woseri wa Israeli wankukuhepera, su guwagambiri gaa hakaweri mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Hera hangu ndiri, ayilawiri handa gwenga paguhowa neni pamuhera na mwana gwangu Selemani hatutozwi handa twana makosa.” <verse eid="1KI 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Pakaweriti kankuyowera na Mfalumi, mbuyi Natani kingiriti kuliboma. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />“Wamgambira mfalumi mbuyi Natani kapanu, kasoka na kamsuntamalira na kamng'ong'onalira mfalumi mpaka sheni shakuyi shisoka pasi.” <verse eid="1KI 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Shakapanu Natani kamgambira, “Mtuwa gwangu, hashi, gulongiti, Adoniya hakaweri mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi na hakalikali pampindi pa shiti shaneni sha shifalumi? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Toziya leru kasuluka kalaviyi shijungu sha ng'ombi na vya vyatawi na kondolu wavuwa na kawashemera wana wa mfalumi, wakulu wa mashonta na mtambika Abiyatali, na guloli, wankuliya na kulanda palongolu pakuyi na kulonga, 'Gulikali mashaka gavuwa mfalumi Adoniya! <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Kumbiti kanshemera ndiri neni ntumintumi gwaku pota mtambika Sadoki ama Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada ama ntumintumi gwaku Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Hashi goseri aga gugatenda gwenga mtuwa gwangu mfalumi pota kuwagambira wantumintumi waku muntu hakaweri mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Mfalumi Dawudi kankula, “Gunshemeri Betisheba.” Na kamgendera mfalumi na kugoloka palongolu pakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Shakapanu mfalumi kalilapa pakalonga, “Nakaka Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalikala, yakayilopoziyiti neni muntabiku yoseri, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />Ntambu yanililapiliti kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli panongiti, kuwera mwana gwaku Selemani ndo hakakolimlima pa neni na hakaweri mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi, na ashi ndo shanfira kutenda leru.”<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Ndo Batisheba pakang'ong'onaliti mpaka pasi na kalonga, “Mtuwa gwangu mfalumi Dawudi kalikali mashaka gavuwa!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />“Shakapanu mfalumi Dawudi kalonga, gunshemeri mtambika Sadoki, na mbuyi Natani na Beneya mwana gwa Yehoyada. Na womberi wamwiziliti mfalumi.” <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />Mfalumi kawagambira, “Gugendi na wantumintumi wangu. Gumkweniziyi mwana gwangu Selemani pampindi pa punda farasi gwa neni, na gumseriziyi mpaka bwiru ya Gihoni, <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />shakapanu gumjimiri mtambika Sadoki na mbuyi Natani wamswagi lipaki kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli. Mgombi lipenga na kulonga, mfalumi Selemani kalikali makaliru gavuwa! <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Mwenga hamumgenderi na yomberi hakizi na kuwera mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi na neni nimsyagula kaweri mkolamlima gwa Israeli na Yuda.” <verse eid="1KI 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Beneya mwana gwa Yehoyada pakamwankuliti mfalumi, “Yina haa! Mtuwa Mlungu gwa mtuwa gwangu mfalumi na kalongi ntambu irahayi. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakaweriti na mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, kaweri viraa na Selemani na kautendi ufalumi wakuyi uweri mkulu kuliku ufalumi wa mtuwa gwangu mfalumi Dawudi.” <verse eid="1KI 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Su, mtambika Sadoki, na mbuyi Natani, na Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada na Wakereti na Wapereti woseri waseleriti na kumkweniziya Selemani mupunda farasi gwa mfalumi Dawudi na kumjega mpaka Gihoni <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Shakapanu mtambika Sadoki katoliti magoli ga lipaki lyakajegiti kulawa kuliringu linanaga na kumswaga lipaki Selemani kuwera mfalumi. Shakapanu wagombiti lipenga na wantu woseri pawalonga, “Kalikali mashaka mavuwa Mfalumi Selemani!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Shakapanu wantu woseri wamfatiti, pawagomba filimbi na pawanemelera kwa sheleku nkulu, ata isi ibegiziwa kwa liziwu lyawu. <verse eid="1KI 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Su, Adoniya pamuhera na wahenga yawaweriti na yomberi wapikaniliti wantu awa pawamaliriti msambu. Na Yoabu pakapikaniriti liziwu lya lipenga kalongiti, “Umatu awu kumjini ndo wa shishi?” <verse eid="1KI 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Pakaweriti kankulonga, kumbiti, Yonatani mwana gwa mtambika Abiyatali, kingiriti. Shakapanu, Adoniya kalonga, “Gwingiri Toziya gwenga gwa muntu gwa mana handa gwenga, haguweri gutujegera shisoweru shiwagira.” <verse eid="1KI 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Yonatani ndo pakamwankuliti Adoniya, “Ndala, toziya mfalumi Dawudi kamtenda Selemani kaweri mfalumi. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Na Mfalumi Kamjega pamuhera na mbuyi Sadoki, mbuyi Natani na Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada na Wapiriti na Wakereti na womberi wamkweziya pampindi pa punda farasi gwa mfalumi, <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />Shakapanu mtambika Sadoki na mbuyi Natani wamswaga lipaki kaweri mfalumi kulii Gihoni. Hangu walawa panu pawanemelera, ndo toziya ya umatu awu yaguupikiniriti. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Vinu Selemani kawera mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Nentu ya aga, wantumintumi wa mfalumi wiziti kumzyuma mtuwa gwetu Mfalumi Dawudi pawalonga, Mlungu gwaku kalitendi litawu lya Selemani kuwera limanika kuliku lyaku, viraa hakaweri mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi. Shakapanu mfalumi Dawudi kang'ong'onala na kuguwira mushitanda shakuyi, <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />na kuluwa pakalonga, kazyumwi Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli, mweni katenda mwiwuku gwangu kuwera mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi na yomberi kampanana makaliru ata nigawona aga.”<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Su, wahenga wa Adoniya watira nentu, na wawuka na kupalanganika. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Na Adoniya, toziya kamtiriti Selemani, katugiriti Muliringu lya Mtuwa Mlungu kagakola magoli ga shitalawanda su kapati kuponeka <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Mfalumi Selemani kapata shisoweru handa Adoniya kaweriti katugiriti kuliringu na handa kagakolera magoli ga shitalawanda pakalonga, “Hapeni mbuki mpaka mfalumi Selemani kanapili leru handa hapeni kantagi neni ntumintumi gwakuyi kwa ligumba.” <verse eid="1KI 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Mfalumi Selemani kalonga, “Panimwona kuwera mwaminika su hapeni kapati madoda goseri. Kumbiti panimwona kana madoda mpaka kahowi.”<verse eid="1KI 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Su, Mfalumi Selemani kalagalira Adoniya kashemwi kulawa kuliringu linanagala, kizi kwakuyi. Adoniya kasokiti kulongolu kwa mfalumi, kang'ong'onala kwa ligoya. Mfalumi kamgambira, “Gugendi ukaya kwaku.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Lagalira lya Dawudi kwa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Dawudi pakaweriti pakwegera kuhowa, kamshemiti mwana gwakuwi Selemani, kampanana lagalira pakalonga, <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />“Mwana gwangu, ntambu yayiwera kwa viwumbi vyoseri kuhowa, mashaka gangu gapera. Guweri shikambaku na mgangamala. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />Gutenda malagalira ga Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku. Gufati njira zakuyi na gukoli lagiru zakuyi na amuli zakuyi na toza zakuyi na matakulu gakuyi, ntambu yayilembitwi mulilagaliru lya Musa su gupati mpatilu mukila shagutenda na koseri kwagugenda, <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />su Mtuwa Mlungu kashigangamaziyi shisoweru shakuyi shakatakuliti kuusu neni pakalonga, payiwera wiwuka waneni hawajimiri amuli zyakuwi na kumtendara kwa kwaminika woseri kwa moyu goseri, shaka shoseri hapeni gukosi muntu yakawera mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />Nentu ya aga, guvimana viraa galii gakantendiriti Yoabu mwana gwa Seluya, ntambu yakawatendiriti wakulu wa mashonta wawili wa shonta lya Israeli, Abineri mwana gwa Neri na Amasa mwana gwa Yateri. Kawalagiti, kita mwazi shaka sha ponga handa shaka sha nkondu, na mwazi gwakuyi kagupakaziya mulufunga kuzyengeta shunu na vilwatu vyakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Su gwenga gutendi shiyasi sha luhala lwaku, ila hera nagumleka kahowi kwa ponga.<verse eid="1KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />Kumbiti guwatenderi maheri wana gwa Bazilayi, kulawa Mgileyadi na guwatuli weri waweri pakati pa walii yawaliya pameza paku, toziya wantendiriti maheri shaka panimtiriti na kumtuga mlongu gwaku Abisalomu.” <verse eid="1KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />“Viraa, kapalaapa Shimeyi mwana gwa Gera, likabila lya Benjamini kulawa mji gwa Bahurimu, Mweni kanapiliriti na kumpangira nentu pang'enditi Mahanaimu, kumbiti pakiziti kunanka kulushemba lwa Yoridani, nimlapiriti kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu panimgambira, hapeni nikulagi kwa ligumba. <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Kumbiti gwenga nagumleka hera hangu. Gwenga gwana ligoya, haguvimani shagufira kumtendera, tembera yomberi kana neziwu.”<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Dawudi kahowiti, kafindilwa kumji gwa gwakuwi, yagushemwa mji gwa Dawudi. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Kaweriti kakolamlima Israeli kwa shaka sha vinja alubayini, vinja saba pakawera Hebroni, na vinja selasini na tatu pakawera Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Su, Selemani kawera mfalumi pahala pa Dawudi tati gwakuwi na ufalumi wakuyi uweriti ugangamala.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Adoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Shakapanu Adoniya, mwana gwa Higiti, kamgendiriti Batisheba, mawu gwakuwi Selemani. Basheba kamkosiya, “Hashi gwakwiza kwa ponga?” Adoniya kamwankula, “Yina, niza kwa ponga. <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Ila nana shisoweru shimu sha kukugambira.” Betisheba kamgambira, “Gulongi hera.”<verse eid="1KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Adoniya kamgambira, “Guvimana handa neni meweri mfalumi na ata Israeli yoseri iweriti yankunolelera nweri mfalumi. Kumbiti mirandu ing'alambuka na mlongu gwangu kang'alambula toziya aga ndo yagaweriti mafiru gakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Na vinu nanayi luwa yimu hera yeni nikuluwa nagumbelera.” Betisheba kamgambira, “Gulongi hera.”<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Na yomberi kalonga, “Shonde, nikuluwa gumluwi mfalumi Selemani kanjimili nimtoli Abishagi, ulii muntu gwa Shunami, kaweri mdala gwangu, toziya nivimana hapeni kakubeleri.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Betisheba kamgambira, “Sawa, hanyoweri na mfalumi kwajili ya gwenga”<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Su, Betisheba kamgendera mfalumi Selemani kumgambira luwa ya Adoniya. Mfalumi kagoloka kagenda kumwanka mawu gwakuyi, kamng'ong'onalira. Shakapanu kalivaga mshiti shakuyi sha ukulu, kalagalira mawu gwakuyi kajegerwi shiti, na yomberi kalivaga uwega wa kumliwu wa mfalumi. <verse eid="1KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Batisheba kalonga, “Nina luwa ndidini shonde gunjimiri na nikuluwa nagumbelera.” Mfalumi kamgambira, “gulongi luwa yaku mawu gwangu, toziya hapeni nikubeleri,”<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Na yomberi kalonga, “Gumjimiri mlongu gwaku Adoniya kamyugi Abishagi, gwa kulawa Shunami.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Mfalumi Selemani kamgambira mawu gwakuyi, “Na vii gumfira Adonia Abishagi muntu kulawa Shunani? Gumfiliri na ufalumi viraa toziya yomberi ndo mlongu gwangu mkulu viraa, mtambika Abiatari na mkulu gwa mashonta Yoabu mwana gwa Seluya wa uwega wakuyi!” <verse eid="1KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Panu mfalumi Selemani kalilapa kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, pakalonga, “Mlungu na kanagiri kutali payiwera Adoniya hapeni kahowi toziya ya kulaviya luwa ayi! <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Vinu, kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, yakantuliti na kugangamaziya ufalumi wa tati gwangu Dawudi, na yakatenditi shakalongiti, kampanana ukulu neni na wiwuka wangu, Nililapa handa leru ayi Adoniya hakahowi!” <verse eid="1KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Hangu mfalumi Selemani kamlagalira Benaya, mwana gwa Yehoyada, na kamgendera Adoniya na kumlaga.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoabu kankulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Mfalumi Selemani kamgambira mtambika Abiyatali, “Guwuki gugendi kulilambu lyaku aku Anatoti, Gufiruwa kulaguwa gwenga! Kumbiti vinu, hapeni nikulagi toziya gulitoliti Lisanduku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu paguweriti na tati gwangu Dawudi, gutabisiyitwi pamuhera na yomberi.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Hangu mfalumi Selemani kamwinga Abiyatali, nakawera mtambika gwa Mtuwa Mlungu aku Shilu, ayi iwera nakaka kwa mtambika Eli na lukolu lwakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Yoabu pakapatiti shisoweru, katugiriti kuligeleri lya lilingu Linanagala lya Mlungu na kugakolera magoli ga shitalawanda, toziya kaweriti kamjimilira Adoniya kumbiti Abisalomu ndiri. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Mfalumi Selemani pakapikaniriti handa Yoabu katugiliti muliringu lya Mlungu na handa kagoloka pashitalawanda, kamtumiti Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada, pakalonga, “Gugendi gwakamlagi.” <verse eid="1KI 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Su, Benaya kagenda kuligeleri lya liringu lya Mlungu, kamgambira Yoabu, “Mfalumi kang'ambira gulawi kunja.” Yoabu kankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">“Neni hapenindawi, hamfuwiri palapanu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Benaya kawuya kwa mfalumi na kumgambira ntambu yakamwankuliti Yoabu. <verse eid="1KI 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Selemani kalonga, “Gutendi ntambu yakalongiti, gumlagi na kumfindira. Hangu neni na wiwuka wamonga woseri wa Dawudi hapeni tutakulwi madoda kwa vitendu vya Yoabu kwa kuwalaga wantu yawahera vidoda. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />Mlungu kamwazibu Yoabu kwa kulaga aku kwakatenditi pota tati gwangu Dawudi kuvimana visoweru avi. Yomberi kawalagiti wantu wawili weni waweriti wa mana nentu kuliku yomberi, viraa wamziditi kwa maheri, kawalagiti Abineri mwana gwa Neri, mkulu gwa shonta lya Israeli na Amasa mwana gwa Yeteri, mkulu gwa lishonta lya Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Azabu ya kulaga aku hayiweri pampindi pa Yoabu na wiwuka wakuyi mashaka goseri. Ila Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapanani ponga wiwuka wa Dawudi mashaka goseri yawafira kukalira shiti shakuyi sha ukulu.”<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Su, Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada, kagenda mlilingu linanagala, kamlaga Yoabu mweni wamfindiriti mkaya kwawu, kushiwala. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Mfalumi kamtula Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada, kaweri mkulu gwa shonta pahala pa Yoabu, na Sadoki kawera mtambika pahala pa Abiyatali.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Shimeyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Shakapanu mfalumi kalagalira Shimeyi kashemwi, kamgambira, “Gulinyawiri numba amu Yerusalemu. Gulikali panu pota kugenda pahali pamonga poseri. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Toziya lishaka pagulawa na kuloka mbwilu ya Kidironi, nukugambira nakaka haguhowi, na kulilawumu gamweni kwa kuhowa kwaku.”<verse eid="1KI 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Shemeyi kankula, “Yina Mfalumi. Handendi ntambu yagulongiti.” Su, kalikaliti Yerusalemu mashaka gavuwa.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />“Kumbiti muupeleru wa shinja sha tatu, wamanda wawili wa Shimeyi watolikiti, wagenda kwa Akishi mwana gwa Maaki, mfalumi gwa Gati. Shimei kapikaniliti shisoweri ashi pakaweliti aku Gati,” <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />Shimeyi kakweniti punda farasi gwakuyi, kagenditi aku kuwasakula, kwa mfalumi Akishi kulawa Gati. Su, kasoka kawapata kawawuziya ukaya. <verse eid="1KI 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Mfalumi Selemani pakapatiti visoweru handa Shimeyi kaweriti kalawa Yerusalemu na kagenda Gati na kuwuya, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />kamshemiti Shimeyi na kumgambira, “Hashi, nikutenda ndiri gunapiliti kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu hapeni gulawi Yerusalemu. Na neni nukuberiziya pagulawa nakaka haguhowi, handa pagujeri kugenda kunja? Na gwenga gunjimira, gung'ambira, yina, nikujimira. <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Hashi gumega shirapu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kulishera ndiri lagiru lyanikupananiti? <verse eid="1KI 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Mfalumi kendereyiti kumgambira Shimeyi, guvimana weri makontola gagumtenderiti tati gwangu Dawudi, su vinu toziya ya aga Mtuwa Mlungu hakakukomangi. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Kumbiti neni hakandekeleri, na shiti sha ukulu sha Dawudi hashigangamiziwi palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Panu mfalumi kamgambira Benaya mwana Yehoyada, na yomberi kalawa, kamkoma na kumlaga Shimeyi. Su, ufalumi ugangamala pasi pa Selemani.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Selemani kankuluwa luhala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 1:3-12">2 Mirandu 1:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Selemani katenditi uganja na Falawu mfalumi wa Misri, kamyuga mhinga gwakuyi. Kamjega mhinga gwa Falawu na kumtula mumji gwa Dawudi mpaka pakamaliliti kunyawa numba yakuwi mweni. Numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na shibambaza sha kuzyengeta mji gwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Shaka ashi, wantu waweriti wankulaviya tambiku pahala pampindi papanyawitwi, toziya numba Mtuwa Mlungu iweriti haweni nyawi. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Selemani kamfiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, kagafata malongoleru ga Dawudi, tati gwakuwi, ila hera yomberi kafiruwitwi kulaviya tambiku ya kulunguziya ubani pahala pampindi papanyawitwi.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Shaka shimu, Selemani kagenditi kulaviya tambiku aku Gibeoni, toziya ndo paweriti pahapa pampindi panyawitwi pamanika na panu kaweriti kalaviya elufu za tambiku za kulunguziwa panu kwanja. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Aku Gibiyoni Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawiriti Selemani mkulota pashiru, kamgambira, “Guluwi shoseri shagufira hanikupanani.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Selemani kamgambira, “Gumlanguziyiti lusungu luvuwa ntumintumi gwaku Dawudi tati gwangu, toziya kakutenderiti kwa waminika, moyu guherepa na ntambu yayimfiliziya Mlungu, na kumlanguziya lusungu lwaku kwa kumpanana mwana yakalikala vinu kushiti sha ukulu. <verse eid="1KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />Gwee Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu, guntula neni ntumintumi gwaku kuwera mfalumi pahala pa tati gwangu Dawudi, tembera nankali mwana mdidini na nivimana ndiri ntambu ya yanfiruwa kutenda. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Na panu guntula pakati pa wantu waku weni guwasyagula, na womberi ndo wavuwa ata waweza ndiri kuwalangika kwa uvuwa wawu. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Hangu, nikuluwa gumpanani neni ntumintumi gwaku moyu gwa kupikanira su niwamuyi wantu waku, su mwezi kuvimana maheri na madoda, toziya ndo gaa yakaweza kuwatoza wantu waku yawawera wavuwa hangu?” <verse eid="1KI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Luwa ayi ya Selemani imhelepeziyiti Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Mtuwa mlungu kamgambira, “Toziya gulaviya luwira ayi, na guliluwira ndiri makaliru matali awu ulunda, na pota kuluwa wankondu waku wahowiziwi, su guliluwira umani wa kulaviya utoza pota likosa. <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />Su, vinu nikutendera ntambu yaguluwiti. Guloli, nikupanana ligoya na mahala geni kwahera muntu yumonga yakapatiti kuwera naga pamberi paku, pota kulawira yumonga handa gwenga na pa gwenga. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Viraa, hanikupanani galii geni gugaluwiti ndiri, hanikupanani ulunda na ligoya nentu ya mfalumi yumonga yoseri gwa shaka shaku. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Kayi handa pagufata njira na malagalira gangu na kukola lagiru zyangu ntambu yakatenditi tati gwaku Dawudi, su hanikupanani makaliru matali.”<verse eid="1KI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Selemani pakimukiti, kavimaniti handa iweriti kalota. Ndo kawuya Yerusalemu, na kagoloka palongolu pa Lisanduku la lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu na kamlavilira tambiku ya kulunguziya na za ponga. Shakapanu kawatendera msambu wantumintumi wakuyi woseri.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani kankutoza lisitaka likamala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Lishaka limu wadala wawili wahumba, wagenditi kwa Mfalumi Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Yumu gwawu pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa gwangu, neni na myangu ayu tulikala numba yimu, neni neriti mwana shaka myangu kaweriti kamlaamu. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Mashaka matatu shakapanu, na ayu viraa kaleriti mwana. Paweriti ndiri na muntu yumonga ukaya su twenga wawili hera. <verse eid="1KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />Shakapanu, pashiru pamu, mwana gwakuyi kahowiti toziya kamgojera. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Shakapanu kimuka pashiru ligonugonu, kamtola mwana gwangu kulawa pabwega paneni shaka neni nampota, kamgojeka pashitanda pakuyi. Shakapanu kamtola mwana gwakuyi yakahowiti, kagagonjeka pashitanda pangu. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Panimukiti mandawira na kufira kumnoniziya mwana gwangu, mona mwana kahowa. Panimlolitiloliti weri, nyambula handa kaweriti ndiri mwana gwangu yanimwiwuliti.”<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Kumbiti mdala yumonga kalonga, “Ndala! Mwana gwangu ndo yakawera mkomu, na gwaku ndo yakahowiti!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Na yomberi mdala gwa kwanja kalonga, “Ndala! Mwana gwaku ndo yakahowiti, na gwaneni ndo ayu yakaweriti mkomu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Su wendereya kukakatalana hangu palongolu pa Mfalumi.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Shakapanu Mfalumi Selemani kalonga, “Kila yumu gwenu kashonga handa, mwana wakuyi ndo yakaweriti mkomu na yakahowiti gwakuwi ndiri.” <verse eid="1KI 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />“Su mfalumi kalagalira mnjegeli ligumba, mfalumi wamjegera ligumba.” <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Mfalumi kalonga, “Mmudumuli mwana ayu yakawera mkomu vipandi viwili na guvibaguli teratera kwa kila mdala.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Mdala ulii yakaweriti mawu gwakuyi mwana yakaweriti mkomu kaniti lusungu kamgambira mfalumi, “Shonde shondi, mtuwa gwangu, nagumlaga mwana. Gumpanani myangu ayu mwana ayu yakawera mkomu kamtoli yomberi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">Kumbiti mdala yumonga kalonga, “Ndala mwana nakawera gwangu ama gwakuyi. Gumdumuli vipandi viwili.”<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Mfalumi Selemani kalonga, “Nagumlaga mwana! Gumpanani mdala gwa kwanja kamtoli, toziya yomberi ndo mawu gwakuyi.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Wantu woseri wa Israeli pawapikaniriti mfalumi ntambu yakalaviyiti toza ilii wampananiti ligoya nentu, toziya wavimana kapata luhala lwa kuamuwa kulawa kwa Mlungu yakamtenditi kulaviyi utoza.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Wakulu wa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Selemani kaweriti mfalumi gwa isi yoseri ya Israeli, <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />na awa waweriti wakulu pasi wakuyi, Azaliya mwana gwa Sadoki, kaweriti mtambika. <verse eid="1KI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Elihorefu na Ahiya wana wa Shausha, waweriti walemba, Yehoshafati mwana gwa Alihudi, kaweriti mlemba gwa maholu. <verse eid="1KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Benaya mwana gwa Yohada, kaweriti mkulu gwa shonta, na womberi Sadoki na Abiyatali, waweriti watambika. <verse eid="1KI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Azariya mwana gwa Natani, kaweriti mkulu gwa mkolamlima, mtambika Zabudi mwana gwa Natani, kaweriti ganja gwa mfalumi. <verse eid="1KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahishari kaweriti mkulu gwa liboma na Adoniramu mwana gwa Abuda, kaweriti mgolokera wa lihengu lya kukakanika. <verse eid="1KI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Selemani kawasyaguliti wakulu wa wakolamlima lilongu na mbili kwa isi yoseri ya Israeli. Hawa wapananitwi lihengu lya kusakula shiboga kulawa kumkowa gwakuyi kwajili ya mfalumi mwezi gumu kila shinja. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Aga ndo matawu ga wakulu wakolamlima, Beni Huri kagolokiriti pahala pa vigongu vya Efraimu <verse eid="1KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Beni Dekeri kagolokiriti mji gwa Makai, na Shaalibimu na Beti Shemeshi na Elonibeti Hanani <verse eid="1KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Beni Hesedi kagolokeriti mji gwa Aruboti, viraa kagolokeriti Soku na isi yoseri ya Heferi. <verse eid="1KI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Beni Abinadabu, mpalu gwa Tafati, mhinga gwa Selemani, kagolekeriti uwega woseri wa Nafati Dori. <verse eid="1KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Baana mwana gwa Ahiludi, kagolekeriti mji gwa Taanaki na Megidu na pahala poseri pa Beti Sheani yaiweri pakwegera na mji gwa Zareti, kusika kwa mji gwa Yezireeli, na kulawa Beti Sheani mpaka mji gwa Abeli Mehola na ata kupita miji ya Yokimeamu <verse eid="1KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Beni Gebari, kagolekeriti mji gwa Ramoti Gileadi pamuhera na vijiji vya Gileadi viwera vya Yairi, mwana gwa Manase, viraa kagolekeriti mkoa wa Aligobu haguweri Beshani, yoseri iweriti miji mikulu sitini yaizyengetiritwi vibambaza na kutula gwiligiziwu za shaba mumigomi mikulu. <verse eid="1KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ahinadabu mwana gwa Idu, kapananwa lihengu lya kujojonira shiboga muisi ya Mahanaimu na vijiji vyakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimaasi mpalu gwakuyi Besemati yakaweriti mhinga gwa Selemani, kapananwa lihengu lya kujojonira shiboga muisi ya Nafutali. <verse eid="1KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Baana mwana gwa Hushai, kapananwa lihengu lya kujojonira shiboga muisi ya Asheri na Bealoti. <verse eid="1KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Yoshefati mwana gwa Parua, kapananwa lihengu lya kujojonira shiboga muisi ya Isakari. <verse eid="1KI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Shimei mwana gwa Ela, kapananwa lihengu lya kujojonira shiboga muisi ya Benjamini. <verse eid="1KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Geberi mwana gwa Uri, kapananwa lihengu lya kujojonira shiboga muisi ya Gileyadi, yeni panu kwanja itolitwi na Sihoni mfalumi gwa Waamori na Ogu mfalumi gwa Bashani. Na yomberi kaweriti mkulu gweka yakuyi muisi ayi.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukolamlima wa Selemani una mpatiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Wantu wa Yuda na wa Israeli waweriti wavuwa handa mhanga gwa kumpwani, nawomberi waweriti waliya na kulanda na kunemelera. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Selemani kakolitimlima falumi zoseri kwanjira lushemba lya Eufrate mpaka isi ya Wafilisiti, mpaka kumbaka na Misri. Isi zoseri waweriti wamtendera lihengu na kulipa kodi kwakuyi shaka shoseri sha ukomu wakuyi <verse eid="1KI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Shiboga shakafiriti Selemani kwa lishaka limu, shiweriti ubumu unama madebi miya tatu na sitini, na ubumu yawasagiti weri uweriti madebi miya saba na ishilini, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />ng'ombi yawajegerwa shiboga lilongu, na ng'ombi wa kumaliwuziwu ishilini, na kondolu miya yimu pamuhera na kulungu na paa na shinjapuli na nkuku watawi. <verse eid="1KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Yina isi yoseri gwaguzyeta mshenji ya lushemba Eufrate, kulawa Tifisa mpaka mji gwa Gaza, iweriti isi ya ukolamlima wakuyi. Wafalumi woseri wa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba Eufrate waweriti pasi pakuyi, na kaweriti na ponga na isi zoseri za pakwegera. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Mashaka goseri ga ukolamlima wakuyi Selemani, wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Israeli, kulawa Dani mpaka Beri Sheba walikali poneka, kila muntu yakaweriti na mitera yakuyi ya mizyabibu na mitini. <verse eid="1KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Selemani kaweriti na visasa elufu alubayini toziya ya farasi wa mbutuka zakuyi za kukwega, na wamashonta wakuyi wa wakwena farasi elufu lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="1KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Walii wakulu wakuyi lilongu na mbili, kila yumu kwa mwezi yakapangiwitwi, wajegiti shiboga shivuwa sha kumpanana mfalumi na woseri walii yawaweriti ukaya kwakuyi. Mafiliru gawu goseri gawatosiyiti. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Kila muntu mushaka shakuyi pashisokiti, kajegiti viraa shayiri na ndundu za kumliziya punda farasi na wavigong'olu yawagenda kalongola. <verse eid="1KI 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Mlungu kamupananiti Selemani luhala nentu na mahala na umana uvuwa handa mhanga gwa kumbwani, gawera ndiri na shipimu. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Luhala lya Selemani lulipititi luhala lya wantu wa kwagulawa mshenji na lulisinditi luhala lya wantu wa Misri. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Kawakankiti wantu woseri kwa luhala, kawakankiti Etani, kulawa mlukolu lwa Mwezirahi na Hemani na Kalikoli na Darida, wana wa Maholi, na kuzyumwa kwakuyi kweneya muisi zoseri zyapakwegera <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Mitakulu yakuyi iweriti elufu tatu na nyimbu nentu ya elufu yimu na miya mhanu. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Kayoweriti visoweru vya mitera, kwanjira mtera gwa mwelezi yaguwera Lebanoni, ata hisopu, mtera yagutambala mshibambasa. Katakuliriti viraa wankanyama na wampongu wana mwazi guzizima yawatagira maligi na somba. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Wantu kulawa maisi goseri na wafalumi woseri yawapatiti kupikanira shisoweru sha luhala lyakuyi, wiziti kumpikanira.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Selemani kankulitanda kunyawa numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 2:1-18">2 Mirandu 2:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Mfalumi Hiramu gwa Tiru, yakaweriti ganja gwa Dawudi, pakapatiti shisoweru handa Selemani kaswagwa lipaki kawera mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi, katumiti wantumintumi wakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Selemani kamwuziliriti Hiramu ulagilagi hawu, <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Guvimana handa tati gwangu Dawudi kaweza ndiri kumnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi, numba ya Mlungu ya kumguwira, toziya ya nkondu yayiweriti imuzyengeta wega zoseri na isi ya pakwegera mpaka panu Mtuwa Mlungu pakamupananiti ukanka kwa wankondu wakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Kumbiti vinu, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu, kampanana ponga wega zoseri. Nahera mnkondu ama ntabiku. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Hangu amuwa kumnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu, numba ya kumguwira. Ayi ndo teratera nakamu handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiziyiti tati gwangu pakalonga. Mwana gwaku, mweni hanimtendi kalivagi pashiti shaku sha ukulu, hakanyawili numba! <verse eid="1KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />Vinu su, guwagambiziyi wantu waku wandumuliri mtera ya miyerezi ya Lebanoni. Wantu wa neni hawaweri pamuhera na wantu waku mlihengu ali, naneni haniwalipi wantu waku ntambu yagulonga, hangu ntambu yaguvimana, kwahera kwatwenga muntu yoseri yakanaumana wa kudumula mitera handa mwenga Wasidoni.” <verse eid="1KI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Hiramu kanemeliriti nentu pakapatiti ulagilagi awu wa Selemani, kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu kazyumi shaka ashi, kwa kumpanana Dawudi mwana yakana luhala hakakolimlima wantu awa wavuwa.” <verse eid="1KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Shakapanu Hiramu kamjegera Selemani ulagilagi, pakalonga, “Nanka ulagilagi waku, naneni nakala kutenda mafiliru gaku kuusu mbawu za miyerezi na mitera ya miberushi. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Wantu waneni hawapapi magogu na kugaseliziya kulawa Lebanoni mpaka kubahali na kugatawa mafungumafungu gayeruki pampindi pamashi mpaka pahala pagung'ambiziya. Aku hagayopoluwi, na gwenga hagugangi. Kwa uwega waku, gwenga hagumpanani shiboga toziya ya wantu wa ukaya kwaneni.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Su, Hiramu kampanana Selemani mbawu zoseri za miyerezi na mibereshi zyakafiriti, <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />na Selemani kampanana Hiramu nganu madebi laki mbili na alubayini elufu, na lipaki liherepa madebi miya mbili kila shinja, toziya ya wantu wa ukaya kwakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu kampanana Selemani luhala ntambu yakamgambiriti kala. Kuweriti na ponga pakati pa Selemani na Hiramu, watenda mapatanu pakati pawu.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Mfalumi Selemani kajojoniriti wantu selasini elufu kulawa kila pahala muisi ya Israeli, watendi lihengu lya kukakanika. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />Kamtula Adoniramu kaweri mgolokera gwawu. Kawabagula wantu awa muvipinga vitatu vya wantu elufu lilongu kila yumu kajega vipinga avi kwa zamu mwezi gumu Lebanoni na miyezi miwili ukaya. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Selemani kaweriti viraa na wapapa visanka elufu sabini, na wasongola mabuhi kuvigongu elufu semanini,<verse eid="1KI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />viraa na walongoziya elufu tatu na miya tatu yawagolokiriti lihengu ali na yawatenda mahengu woseri. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Kwa lagalira ya mfalumi, wabawiti mabuhi makulu na ga ulunda, su gasongolwi toziya ya kunyawira lyanjiru lya numba. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Su hangu ndo wanyawa wa Selemani na Hiramu na wantu wa mji gwa Gebali ntambu yawatanditi mabuhi na mbawu za kunyawira numba ayi.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Selemani kankunyawa numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Selemani kanjiti kunyawa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu mushinja sha mia msheshi na semanini pa Waisraeli kulawa Misri, ashi shiweriti shinja sha msheshi sha ukolamlima wa Selemani muisi ya Israeli, mumwezi gwa Zifu. Ndo mwezi gwa pili <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Numba ayi mfalumi Selemani kamnyawiliti Mtuwa Mlungu iweriti na utali wa mita ishilini na saba na upana wa mita tisa na utali mita lilongu na tatu na sentimita mhanu. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Pakwingilira panumba paweriti na upana wa mita msheshi na nusu kulawa uwega wumu wa numba na uwega umonga. Na utali wakuyi kulongolu kwa numba ayi uweliti mita tisa. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Katuliriti numba ayi madilisha makulu kwa mngati na madidini kwa kunja. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Viraa kanyawiti mbanda kuzyengeta, su kugangamaziya shibambaza sha kunja, kanyawa vyumba vya mubwega kila uwega. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Vyumba vya pasi, muvyumba avi vya kongera, viweriti na upana wa mita mbili na sentimita mbili ya golofa yayifatiti iweriti na upana wa mita mbili sentimita sabini, na golofa ya pambindi nentu iweriti na upana wa mita ndatu. Golofa azi ziweriti zilinganira ndiri kwa upana toziya Selemani kaweriti kapungula shibambaza sha kunja kuzyengeta numba su boliti za kugangamaziya shibambaza nashikolelerana na shibambasa.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Shaka Numba payiweriti yankunyawiwa papikilirika ndiri ngati mwa numba mliru gwa nyundu, pota shombu shoseri sha shuma toziya inyawitwi kwa mabuwi yagaweriti gasongolwa na kutandwa nakamu aku kwawagatoliti.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Ligomi lya kwingilira seemu ya pasi ya jengu yaliyongilitwi pambwega pa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, liweriti uwega wa kusika. Mngati muweriti na likweneru lyeni wantu waweziti kukwena su kugenda kugolofa ya pakati na ya upeleru. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Su Mfalumi Selemani kamaliriti kunyawa Numba. Litala lya numba kaweriti kanyawa kwa boliti na mbawu za miyerezi. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Kuyizyengeta shibambasa sha kunja sha numba ayi, kanyawiti vyumba vya golofa vyaviweriti na utali kugenda pampindi wa mita mbili sentimiti ishilini na mhanu, na vyeni viweriti vikolaniziwitwi na numba kwa boliti za miyerezi. <verse eid="1KI 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Shaka ashi ulagilagi awu wa Mtuwa Mlungu umwiziliti Selemani, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />“Kwa shisoweru sha numba ayi, handa pagufata mlonguziya gwangu gujimira malagalira gangu na amuli za neni hanikutenderi mirandu yoseri yanimgambiliti tati gwaku Dawudi. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Hanilikali muwamu mwa wiwuka wa Israeli, na hapeni ndeki nakamu.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Su, Selemani kayinyawa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu na kuyimalira.<verse eid="1KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapambu ga mngati ga numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Uwega wa mngati wa numba kawugibikira kwa mbawu za miyelezi kulawa kusakafu mpaka kuboliti za litala, na sakafu kayiyalikira mbawu za miberoshi. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Shumba sha mngati, shishemitwi pahala Pananagala nentu shibagulitwi munumba nkulu ya Mlungu. Shiweriti shinyawa kwa mbawu za miyerezi kulawa kusakafu mpaka kulitala na utali wakuyi uweliti mita tisa. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Shumba shilii shiweliti palongolu pa pahala Pananangala nentu, shiweliti na utali wa mita lilongu na nane. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Mbawu za miyerezi zyaziyalikitwi mushibambaza sha numba mungati ziweliti zipambwa kwa mishoru ya mibuyu na mauwa gabuma. Kila pahala paweriti igubikwa kwa mbawu za miyerezi, ata kwahera libuwi lyaliwonikaniti. <verse eid="1KI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Museemu ya mngati nentu ya numba nkulu ya Mlungu ayi, Selemani katuliti shumba sha gweka Lisanduku lya Lipatanu lya Mlungu litulitwi. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Shumba ashi shiweriti na utali wa mita tisa, na upana mita tisa, na utali kugenda pampindi mita tisa, sheni shigibikwa kwa zahabu iyerepa. Kanyawiti shitalawanda sha mbawu za miyerezi. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Selemani kagibikira kwa zahabu ihelepa seemu ya ngati ya numba, na kulongolu mwa shumba ashi sha mngati katuliti minyololu ya zahabu kulawa uwega wumu mpaka uwega wa pili, kayigibikira kwa zahabu <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Numba nkulu ya Mlungu yoseri kayigibikiliti kwa zahabu, viraa shitalawanda sha pahala Pananagala nentu shigibikitwi viraa kwa zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Kanyawiti kwa mbawu za mizyeyituni viwumbi wawili vyana mbapatiru, kila shiwumbi shiweriti na utali kugenda pampindi mita mbili na lobu, kavitula pananagala nentu. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Kila lupapatiru luweriti na utali wa mita mbili na lobu, hangu utali kulawa upeleru wa lupapatiru lumonga uweriti mita msheshi na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Shiwumbi yumonga kaweliti na utali wa mita msheshi na nusu, viwumbi vyoseli viwili viweliti na vipimu viraavirii na walifana. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Utali wa Shiwumbi yumu kaweliti na mita msheshi na nusu, viraa utali wa shiwumbi shimonga uweriti ulaaulii. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Viwumbi avi viweriti teratera, viwera na mbapatiru za kukusumulwa. Lupapatiru lumu lushinkula shibambaza shimu na lupapatiru lumonga lushinkula shibambaza sha pili, zimonga zilii zishinkuliti pakati pahala pa shumba Shinanagala Nentu. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Na viwumbi avi kavigibikiliti kwa zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Shibambaza sha kila shumba kashiherepeziya kwa mishoru ya viwumbi vyana mbapatiru, mitera ya mitendi na mishoru ya uluwa yawubumiti. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Kavigibikira zahabu musakafu ya vyumba vya mngati na vya kunja. <verse eid="1KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Kwa kwingira shumba sha mngati nakamu Pananagala nentu kanyawiti migomi kwa mbawu za mizeyituni. Vizingiti na miimu ya migomi kavitenditi viweri vya pembi mhanu. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Mumigomi ayi miwiri ya mizyetuni, kasongola viwumbi vyana mbapatiru, mitera ya mitendi na uluwa yawubumiti, kayigubikiliti mishoru ayi kwa zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Ntambu iraayi, kanyawiti ligomi ya mlaba gwa kwingilira pamdamu. Miimu ya ligomi ali iweriti ya mizyetuni, <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />na mbapatiru zakuyi mbili ziweriti za miberoshi, kila libakubaku liweziti kukusumulwa na kukusa pakati. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Pampindi pa ligomi kagibikira viwumbi wana mbapatiru, mitera ya mitendi na uluwa yawubumiti, kayiheripiziya weri mishoru ayi kwa zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Seemu ya mngati ya ligeleri inyawitwi kulongolu kwa numba nkulu ya Mlungu, izyengitiziwa shibambaza sheni sha kwanja sha kozi za mbawu za kila leya ya mabuwi. <verse eid="1KI 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Lyanjiru lya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu linyawitwi mumwezi gwa Zifa. Mushinja sha msheshi wakukolamlima wa Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Mumwezi gwa Buli, ndo mwezi gwa nane, mushinja sha lilongu na yimu unyawa wa numba umalilikiti na lihengu liweriti limalilika ntambu yayitulitwi. Unyawa awu Selemani kawutenditi kwa mivinja saba.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s">Liboma lya Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Selemani kalinyawiti liboma lyakuyi mweni, kwa vinja lilongu na tatu kamalira. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Shakapanu kanyawa lijengu lyalishemitwi numba ya lidowi lwa Lebanoni. Utali wakuyi uweriti mita alubayini na mhanu, upana wakuyi mita ishilini na mbili na nusu na utali wakuyi kugenda pampandi mita lilongu na msheshi. Liweriti linyawitwi pampindi safu zamsheshi za mpanda za miyerezi, mpanda zyeni zikoliriti boliti za miyerezi kwa uwega wa pampindi. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Kila safu iweriti na mpanda lilongu na mhanu, su zoseri pamuhera ziweriti mpanda alubayini na mhanu. Vyumba vyavinyawitwi pampindi pa mpanda azi, kavitulira litala lya miyerezi. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Kuweriti na safu ntatu za madilisha yagalolaniti. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Migomi yoseri na madilisha gaweriti na mlaba kuweriti na safu ntatu ya madilisha na kila shibambaza shililolana uwega wa msitali.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Kanyawiti ligeleri lya mpanda, utali wakuyi uweriti mita ishilini na mbili na nusu na upana wakuyi mita lilongu na msheshi kuseemu ya kulongolu ya jengu ali kuweriti na mdamu. Kulongolu kwa mdamu kuweriti na mpanda, na kulongolu kwa mpanda kulawiriti shitwiku shididini.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Selemani kanyawiti ligeleri lya shiti sha ukulu kweni katozera masitaka ga wantu. Ali vilaa walishemiti ligeleri vya kutoza. Liweriti liherepiziwa kwa mbawu za miyerezi kulawa pasi mpaka kulitala.<verse eid="1KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Numba yakuyi ya kulikala mweni, yayiwiritwi kumbeli pa ligeleri lya Kutoza, liweriti linyawiwa handa zilii zimonga, Selemani viraa kanyawiti numba handa ligeleri ali toziya ya mhinga gwa Falawu, yakaweriti kamyuga.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Majengu goseri aga ganyawitwi kwa mabuwi ga beyi nkulu kulawa lyanjiru mpaka pampindi, mabuwi geni gaweriti gasongolwa kwa shipimu sha gweka, na kudumulwa kwa msumenu uwega wa mngati na wa kunja. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Liyanjiru lyakuyi liweriti lya mabuwi ga beyi nkulu na makulu gana utali wa mita ntatu na nusu, na utali mita msheshi na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Seemu za pambindi zinyawitwi kwa mabuwi gaherepa gamonga yagasongolitwi kwa vipimu vya gweka na mbawu za miyelezi.<verse eid="1KI 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Ligeleri likulu ntambu yaliweriti na shibambaza shana safu yimu za mbawu za miyerezi na safu ntatu za mabuwi ga kusongolwa kila yimu, ntambu yayiweriti handa ligeleri lya mngati mwa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na kwa ligeleri lya numba.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya Hiramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Shakapanu Mfalumi Selemani kamshemiti Hiramu kulawa Tiru. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />Ayu kaweriti mwana gwa mkenja gwa likabira lya Nafutali, na tati gwakuyi kaweriti mwenikaya gwa Tiru, mponda shaba. Hiramu kaweriti na luhala luvuwa na mahala, na fundi mkulu gwa lihengu lyoseri lya shaba. Su, kiziti kwa mfalumi Selemani, kamgendiriti lihengu lyakuyi lyoseri.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpanda mbili za shaba za numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Hiramu kanyawiti mpanda mbili za shaba, kila yimu iweri na utali wa mita nani, na mzyengetu gwa mita mhanu na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Kanyawiti viraa majenjeri mawili ga shaba, kila limu liweriti na utali wa mita mbili na sentimita ishilini na mhanu, kazitula pampindi pa mpanda azi. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Kanyawiti nyavu mbili kila yimu katendiriti mikufu saba katula pampindi pa majenjeri aga. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Ntambu iraayi, kanyawiti mabwajubwaju ntambu ya makomamanga, kagapanga safu mbili kuzyengeta majenjeri galii pampindi pa kila mpanda.<verse eid="1KI 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Na majenjeri aga yagaweriti pampindi pa mpanda kulongolu kwa mdamu, gaherepiziwitwi kwa mifanu ga uluwa wa miyungiyungi, utali wakuyi mita yimu na sentimita sabani mhanu. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Majenjeri aga gaweriti pampindi pa mpanda mbili na viraa ziweriti pampindi pa seemu ya mvilingu yagulawiriti pakwegera na nyavu zilii. Paweriti na mifanu miya mbili ya mabwajubwaju ga mikomamanga gapangitwi misitali miwili kuzyengeta kila lijenjeri.<verse eid="1KI 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Hiramu kazituliti mpanda azi pamdamu gwa numba nkulu ya Mlungu, kazigolosiyiti uwega wa kumliwu kazishemiti Yakini na kazigolosiyiti uwega wa kumshigi kazishemiti Bowazi. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Mituwi ya mpanda azi vilembitwi kwa mfanu gwa uluwa wa miyungiyungi. Na hangu lihengu lya kunyawa mpanda ipera.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sufuliya nkulu ya Shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Hiramu kanyawiti sufuliya yayishemwa bahari, iweriti ya mzyengetu gwa upana mita msheshi na nusu kulawa upeleru mpaka upeleru, na utali wakuyi mita mbili na nusu na mzyengetu gwakuyi goseri mita lilongu na ntatu na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Pasi pa ukingu wakuwi, kulizyengeta litangi ali, kuweriti na msitali miwili ya vibuyu, kila nusu mita kutulitwi vibuyu lilongu. Vibuyu avi viweriti vinyawitwi shaka shiraashi litangi ali palinyawitwi. <verse eid="1KI 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Litangi liweriti litulwa pampindi pa ng'ombi gwa shaba lilongu na mawili, watatu walola uwega wa kushana, watatu uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji, watatu kusika, na watatu uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji. Litangi litulitwi pampindi pa wang'ombi shipalu awa, seemu zawu za kumbeli ziweriti mngati. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Ukulu wa ukingu wakuyi uweriti mita saba na nusu na weni uweriti ulifana na upeleru wa shikombi na handa ligeleli lya yungiyungi. Litangi liweziti kumema mashi lita elufu alubaini.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tololi ya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Hiramu viraa kanyawiti tololi malongu ga shaba, kila tololi iweri na utali wa mita yimu na lobu tatu upana wakuyi viraa mita yimu na lobu tatu, na utali wakuyi kugenda pampindi mita yimu na lobu. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Tololi azi ziweliti zinyawitwi hangu. Kuweliti na mabamba ga chuma gaweriti gakolerelwa na mitalimbu. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Mumabamba kuweriti na shinyagu sha simba na makelubi pampindi pa mabamba aga kuweriti na maheripiziya ga lufunga yagapotitwi weri. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Kila tololi liweriti na maguludumu msheshi ga shaba, na vyuma vya pakati vya kuzyengeta maguludumu aga, gaweriti ga shaba. Kupembi msheshi za tololi kuweriti na vikolera vya shaba toziya ya bilika nkulu. Pakwegera pa kila shikoleru patulitwi mahelepeziya ga uluwa wa kupotwa. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Kuweriti na felemu ya mzyengetu pampindi pa tololi lya bakuli. Yayiweriti na sentimita alubayini na kugenda pasi kuweriti na sentimita lilongu na saba ibikibikwa kwa kuzyengetwa. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Na maguludumu aga msheshi gaweriti pasi pa mabamba galii, vyuma vya pakati kuzyengetiziya maguludumu aga viweriti vikolaniziwa na ntambu ya tololi yeni, na utali wa maguludumu aga gaweriti na sentimita sabini. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Maguludumu aga gaweriti handa mbutuka za kukwega na farasi kunkondu na vyuma vyakuwi vya pakati, mizyengetu yakuyi, mataluma gakuyi na vikombi vyakuyi. Avi vyoseri viweriti vya zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Pasi pa kila tololi kuweriti na migolukeru misheshi kupembi zyakuwi, zyeni zilikolaniziwa na tololi. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Na pampindi pa tololi paweriti na utepi yautendiziya mzyengetu sentimita ishilini na mbili, na vikololeru vya mabamba vyaviweriti uwega wa pampindi vilikolerana na tololi yeni. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Kila mulupenu lupalahera lupatikaniti mvikoleru vya mabamba ga kila tololi, Hiramu kasongoliti mishoru ya makelubi, simba na mitera ya mitendi, kazyengetera na mashada ga mahelepeziya. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Tololi zoseri ziponditwi kwa kulifana, payiwera na utali wumu na ntambu yimu iraayi.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Hiramu, viraa kanyawiti mabilika lilongu ga shaba, limu kwa kila tololi. Kila bakuli iweriti na upana wa mita yimu na lobo tatu, na liweziti kutola mashi lita miya nane semanini. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Katula tololi mhanu uwega wa kumliwu wa numba, na mhanu uwega wa kumshigi, na litangi lilii kalitula kupembi ya kusika kwagulawa mshenji mwa numba.<verse eid="1KI 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vintu vya Numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Hiramu kanyawiti viraa viwungu, masepetu na mabakuli. Su, Hiramu kamaliriti lihengu lyoseri lyakagambiritwi na Mfalumi Selemani kuusu Numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />Mpanda mbili, mabakuli mawili ga lijenjeri lyalitulitwi pampindi pa mpanda, na nyavu mbili kwajili ya kugibikira viwiga viwili aga, <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />Vintu vilifana na makomamanga miya msheshi kwajili ya nyavu mbili azi, safu mbili ya makomamanga kwa kila wavu su kuherepiziya vibuyu virii vyaviweriti pampindi pa mpanda. <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />Ntambu iraa, kanyawiti matololi lilongu, na mabeseni lilongu mumbutuka azi. <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />Na litangi lilii limu na shinyangu sha wang'ombi shipalu lilongu na wawili, pasi pa litangi ali. <verse eid="1KI 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />Shakapanu viwiga virii, kolewu na mabilika, vyombu vyoseri avi viweriti munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu vyeni Hiramu kamnyawiliti mfalumi Selemani, viweriti vya shaba yavikukumulitwi. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Vintu vyoseri avi mfalumi kavinyawiti mumpeku mwa Yoridani, pahala pa litapaka lwa ukaka lwaliweriti pakati pa Sukoti na Seretani. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Selemani kapima ndiri utopa wa vintu avi vyoseri toziya viweriti vivuwa nentu, na toziya utopa wa shaba umanikana ndiri.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Viraa Selemani kanyawiti vintu vyoseri vyaviweriti munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Shitalawanda sha zahabu, meza ya zahabu toziya ya mabumunda ga kutulwa palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />vintambi vya limiliku lya zahabu iyerepa vyavitulitwi palongolu pa pahala pananagala nentu, mhanu uwega gwa kusika na mhanu uwega gwa kushana, uluwa, limiliku, na mikasi, yoseri iweriti ya zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />Vikombi, makasi mididini ga kukatira tambi za limiliku na mabakuli makulu na madidika na vyetezu vyakutulira ubani, mwiku gwa kupalira motu, vyoseri vya zahabu iyerepa, bawabu za migomi ya seemu ya mngati nakamu ya numba palii pahala pananagala nentu na bawabu za migomi ya ligeleri lya kuguwira na numba nkulu ya Mlungu, bawabu zoseri za zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Su, Mfalumi Selemani kamalira mahengu goseri ga numba ya Mlungu. Shakapanu Selemani kajega lunda zoseri zyeni Dawudi kazilumika, feza na zahabu na vintu kavitula muluwanja lwa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lya lipatanu lijegwa munumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:2">2 Mirandu 5:2-6:2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Su, Mfalumi Selemani kawajojoniliti wantu aku Yerusalemu wazewi na wakulu woseri wa makabira na nkolu za Israeli su waliwusiyi lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu kulawa Siyoni ndo mji gwa Dawudi. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Wantu woseri waliwoniti, shaka sha msambu, mumwezi gwa Etanimu, ndo mwezi gwa saba. <verse eid="1KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Pa wazewi woseri wa Israeli kusoka, watambika walipapiti lisanduku lya lipatanu, <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />nakujega Numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Walawi na Watambika wahamiziyiti lisanduku lya lipatanu na liringu linanagala lya kuliwona, na vyombu vinanagala vyoseri vyaviweriti amu Mliringu. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Mfalumi Selemani na mkutanu goseri gwa Israeli wajojonikiti palongolu pa lisanduku lya lipatanu, na womberi walaviya litambiku. Ng'ombi na kondolu yawawalangika ndiri. <verse eid="1KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Shakapanu watambika waliyingiziya lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu pahala pakuyi, mushumba kati mwa numba pahala pananagala nentu, na kulitula pasi pa mbapatiru za makelubi. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Mbapatiru za viumbi avi yavishemitwi makelubi watandaziyiti mbapatiru zawu pampindi pa lisanduku lya lipatanu, pampindi pa mitera ya kupapira lisandiku. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Toziya mitera ayi iweriti mitali nentu, mpeleru zakuyi ziweziti kuwoneka pahala pakuyi pananagala, palongolu pa shumba sha mngati, kumbiti iwezekana ndiri kuwoneka kulawa uwega wakunja. Mitera ayi isigala mpaka leru. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Paweriti ndiri na shintu shoseri mngati mwa lisanduku lya lipatanu ira virii vibawu viwili vya mabuwi vyeni Musa kavituliti amu kulii Herobu, pahala Mtuwa Mlungu katuliti lipatanu na Waisraeli pawalawiti Misri.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Iwera, watambika pawalawiti palii pahala pananagala liwundu limemiziya numba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Ata watambika wasinditi kugoloka su watendi lihengu lyawu toziya ya liwundi ali, toziya Mlungu kalilanguziya kamnumba yakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />“Shakapanu Selemani kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga handa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">hakalikali muluwindu totolu. <verse eid="1KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Nakaka nikunyawira numba nkulu iherepa ya kulikala, pahala pa kulikala mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani kankuwabwelera wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Shakapanu, Selemani kawagalambukira wantu woseri wa Israeli, pawawera wagoloka kawatekelera. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />Kalonga, “Kakwiswi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, toziya kwa makakala gakuyi katenda shakalongi kamupanani tati gwangu Dawudi pakalonga, <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />Kwanjira paniwawusiyiti wantu wa neni Israeli muisi ya Misri, syagula ndiri mji goseri mumakabira ga Israeli su nyawirwi numba yakumguwira, kumbiti nimsyagula Dawudi, kawakolimlima wantu waneni Israeli.”<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />Hangu, “Tati gwangu Dawudi mmoyu mwakuyi kafiliti kunyawa numba yakumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira tati gwangu Dawudi, ndo iherepa handa gufiriti mumoyu mwaku kunyawira numba. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Ata hangu, ndo gwenga ndiri hagunyawili numba, ila mwana gwaku mweni hakanyawiri numba ayi.”<verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />“Na vinu, Mtuwa Mlungu katenditi shilii shakalongiti, toziya nwera mfalumi badala ya tati gwangu Dawudi, na kushivagira shiti sha shifalumi sha Israeli handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatakuliti, viraa nyawa numba ya kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Nentu ya aga, ndula gweka pahala pa kutula lisanduku lya lipatanu lyeni mngati mwakuyi mna lipatanu lyakatenditi Mlungu na tati gwetu, shaka pakawalaviyiti muisi ya Misri.”<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maluwa ya Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Shakapanu Selemani kagolokiti palongolu pa shitalawanda, na yomberi pakawera palongolu pa wantu woseri wa Israeli, kanyasuliti mawoku gakuyi kumpindi. <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />Pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kwahera Mlungu yumonga handa gwenga, kumpindi, ama pasipanu! Gwenga gwa mwaminika, toziya guntendera lipatanu lyaku na kuwalanguziya mafiliru gaku kwa wantumintumi waku yawalikala pawakujimira kwa moyu gwawu goseri. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Gutenda shagulongiti kwa ntumintumi gwaku Dawudi tati gwangu, galii gagulongiti gugatenda leru kwa uwezu waku gamweni. <verse eid="1KI 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />Hangu vinu, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, nikuluwa viraa gutendi shagulongiti kwa ntumintumi gwaku Dawudi tati gwangu, pagulonga. Mashaka goseri haguweri na mwiwuka gwa kulikala mushiti sha mfalumi sha Israeli, payiwera wiwuka waku hawaweri waloleru kuusu mgenderanu gwawu palongolu pa neni handa gwenga ntambu yagutenditi palongolu paneni. <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Su, gwee Mlungu gwa Israeli, nikuluwa gutendi goseri aga gagumgambiriti ntumintumi gwaku Dawudi tati gwangu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />“Kumbiti, gwee Mlungu, nakaka hagulikali pasi panu? Payiwera ata mpindi za kumpindi nentu zikutosiya ndiri, ikutosiyi hashi numba ayi yaniinyawiti? <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Kumbiti gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu, neni ntumintumi gwaku nikuluwa gumpikaniri na kundendera luwa yangu yanduwa leru. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Guyilori numba ayi pashiru na paliwala, pahala peni gulonga, Panu wantu ndo hawalipanani ligoya litawu lyaneni, gumpikaniri paniza pahala panu kuluwa. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Gupikanili maluwiru gangu neni ntumintumi gwaku na ga wantu waku Waisraeli pawaluwa pawalola pahali panu. Gupikanili maluwiru kulawa aku kumpindi kwagulikala, na pagupikanira kala, gutulekeziyi.”<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />“Muntu pakamkoseya myaguyi, na yomberi kajengwa palongolu pa shitalawanda shaku munumba ayi, na yomberi pakalilapa, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />shondi gwenga gupikinili aku kumpindi, gutoli atuwa na kuwatoza wantumintumi waku. Yakawera na likosa gumtozi ntambu ya makosa gakuyi, yakawera ndiri na likosa gumleki kwa waminika wakuyi.”<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />“Payiwera wantu waku Israeli, wasinda na wankondu waku toziya ya vidoda vyawatenditi kwajiri yaku, na womberi pawaluwa kulekiziwa kwawu na kulijimira litawu lyaku pawaluwa guwalekeziyi kwa unanagala munumba ayi, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />su, guwapikaniri kulawa aku kumpindi, guwalikiziyi wantu waku Israeli vidoda vyawu, shakapanu guwawuziyi muisi yaguwapananiti wazeyi wawu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />“Shaka mpindi pazitata na mvula hapeni itowi toziya watenda vidoda wantu awa, na pawaluwa pawalola pahala panu na kulijimira litawu lyaku, na kugalambuka kulawa mvidoda vyawu na guwaazibu, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />shondi, guwapikaniri kulawa aku kumpindi. Na guwalekeziyi vidoda vya wantumintumi waku, wantu waku Israeli, aku paguwafunda kufata njira iherepa, gutowi mvula muisi yaku ayi yeni guwapananiti wantu waku iweri yawu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />“Payiwera kwana njala muisi, ama tauni, na kuyuma, na ulweri wa vimeru, na wanjombi ama vikwitakwita, ama payiwera wantu waku wazyengetwa na wankondu wawu mumji gwawu goseri gulii, payiwera kwana likomangu lyoseri ama ulweri woseri, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />shondi, gupikanili maluwiru goseri yawagaluwa wantu waku, Israeli, ama yagaluwilwa na muntu yoseri ama wantu waku woseri wa Israeli, kila muntu pakavimana ntabiku ya mmoyu mwakuwi, pakakuluwa aku pakalanguziya mawoku gakuyi kulola numba ayi. <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />Su, gupikinili kumpindi aku, gulekiziyi na guwatangi, viraa gumtenderi kila muntu ntambu yakafiruwa ndo gwenga hera guvimana luhala lya mimoyu ya wantu woseri, <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />su wantu wakupanani ligoya nentu shaka shoseri pawalikala muisi yaguwapananiti wambuyi wetu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />“Irahayi, shaka mhenga yakawera ndiri yumu gwa wantu waku Israeli pakiza kulawa isi ya kutali kwajiri ya litawu lyaku, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />mana wantu wa maisi gamonga hawapikaniri zyuma zaku na kuusu likakala na uwezu waku, muntu ayu pakafira kuluwa kaloli munumba ayi, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />nikuluwa gumpikaniri kulawa aku kumpindi, na gumpanani mhenga ayu goseri gakakuluwa, su wantu woseri pasipanu wapati kulimana litawu lyaku na wantu waku wakupanani ligoya nentu handa wantu waku Israeli, na wapati kuvimana handa numba ayi yeni niyinyawa, imanikana kwa litawu lyaku.”<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />“Wantu waku pawagenda kulikomanga kunkondu na wankondu wawu koseri kulii paguwajega, na womberi pawakuluwa pawalola kumji gwagusyaguliti na numba yaniyinyawiti kwajiri ya litawu lyaku, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />nikuluwa gupikanili luwa yawu na maluwiru gawu aku kumpindi, guwapanani ukanka kunkondu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />“Payiwera hawatendi vidoda kwa gwenga toziya kwahera muntu yakatenda ndiri vidoda, na gwenga paguwakalalira na kuwaleka wasindi na wankondu, ata wajengwi lopola mpaka isi ya wankondu yayiwera patali ama pakwegera, <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />handa pawawera aku kwawawajegiti hawagalambuki mimoyu na kuleka vidoda na kukuluwa walekiziwi, pawalonga, Tutenda vidoda, tupotoka na kutenda makontola, <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />viraa shaka ashi payiwera muisi ya wankondu wawu, pawalonga woya vidoda kwa moyu gwawu goseri na kwa rohu yawu yoseri na handa pawakuluwa agawu pawalola mji agu gweni gugusyaguliti na numba ayi yeni niyinyawiti kwajili ya litawu lyaku, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />su, nikuluwa kulawa aku kumpindi gupikanili luwa yawu na guwatangi. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Guwalekeziyi wantu waku vidoda vyawatenditi kwaku na ugalambuka wawu, guwawoneri lusungu palongolu pa wankondu wawu, su wankondu wawu wawawoneri lusungu. <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />Toziya ndo wantu waku, na ndo ulunda waku, wantu weni guwalaviyiti Misri kulawa mukutabika nentu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />“Guloli kuluwa kwa ntumintumi gwaku na kuluwa kwa wantu waku Israeli, guwapikaniri kila pawakuluwa, <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Toziya, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu guwatula gweka wantu wa maisi gamonga pasipanu, su waweri wantu waku gamweni ntambu yagubweriti kwa njira ya Musa, ntumintumi gwaku, shaka shilii paguwalaviyiti wambuyi wetu muisi ya Misri.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luwa ya lupeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Shakapanu Selemani pakamaliliti kuluwa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kagolokiti palii palongolu pa shitalawanda sha Mtuwa Mlungu, pahali pakaweriti kasundamala pakanyasuliti mawoku gakuyi kumpindi. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Kagolokiti, kawatekelera wantu woseri Israeli yawaweriti wajojonikiti panu, pakalonga kwa kubota, <verse eid="1KI 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />“Kakwiswi Mtuwa Mlungu mweni kawatenda wantu wakuyi Israeli woyeri, kulinganira na shilii shakatakuliti. Kwahera ata shishoweru shimu shakasinditi. Shakalongiti shoseri kupitira wantumintumi gwakuyi Musa. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, kaweri na twenga, ntambu yakaweriti kwa wambuyi gwetu, tuluwa nakatuleka, nakatwasa. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Yomberi kalonguziyi miyoyu yatwenga kwakuyi, su tufati njira zakuyi, patukola amuli zakuyi malonguziya gakuyi na malagaliru gakuyi gakawapananiti wambuyi wetu. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Su, visoweru vyangu avi ndo luwa yaneni kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, gaweri pakwegera na Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, paliwala na pashiru, na yomberi kampanani ntumintumi gwakuyi na wantu wakuyi Israeli, su wapati vintu vyawafira kila lishaka. <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />Na wantu wa maisi goseri pasipanu hagamani handa nakaka Mtuwa Mlungu ndo Mlungu, kwahera yumonga. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Na mwenga muweri waminika kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, pamfata malagira gakuyi na kujimira amuli zyakuwi zoseri ntambu yamtenda leru.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Numba nkulu ya Mlungu wayilumika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Shakapanu mfalumi Selemani na Waisraeli woseri yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi wamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Na Selemani kamlaviliyiti Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku za ponga. Ng'ombi ishilini na mbili elufu na kondolu miya yimu na ishilini elufu. Hangu ndo mfalumi na wantu woseri ntambu yawayilumikiti numba ya Mlungu. <verse eid="1KI 8:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Lishaka liraarii, mfalumi kapalumikiti pahala pakati pa ligeleri papaweriti kulongolu kwa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu toziya panu ndo pakalaviyiti tambiku ya kulunguziya, tambiku ya viboga na lipaki lya tambiku ya ponga, toziya ya shitalawanda shilii sha shaba shitosheya ndiri tambiku zoseri azi.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Na Selemani kwa shaka sha mashaka saba na mashaka saba gamonga, kwa mashaka malongu na msheshi katenditi msambu pamuhera na Waisraeli woseri, na womberi walawiti kwanjira shiyingiliru sha Hamati, mpaka lushemba lwa Misri. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Mulishaka lya nane, Selemani kawagambiti wantu kwahere, na womberi wamtekelera mfalumi, wagenda ukaya kwawu pawanemelera toziya ya lusungu lweni Mtuwa Mlungu kalunguziyiti kwa Dawudi, ntumintumi gwakuyi, na kwa wantu wakuyi Israeli.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kamlawira Kayi Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">2 Mirandu 7:11-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Pa mfalumi Selemani pakamaliliti kunyawa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na liboma na kila shintu shakafiriti kunyawa, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawiriti kayi Selemani ntambu yakamlawiriti kulii Gibeyoni. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Mpikaniri kuluwa kwaku na luwa yaku. Niyitenda kuwera nanagala numba ayi yagunyawiriti su nilituli litawu lyaneni panu mashaka goseri. Haniyiloleri na kuyifira shaka shoseri. <verse eid="1KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />Na gwenga handa paguntendera kwa moyu guherepa na uwaminika handa tati gwaku Dawudi ntambu yakatenditi, pagujimira amuli zyaneni na kutenda galii goseri ganakugambiriti, pagufata malagalira ganeni na lagiru ganeni, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />neni hanishigangamiziyi shiti shaku sha shifalumi pampindi pa Israeli mashaka goseri, ntambu yanamgambiriti Dawudi tati gwaku, panonga. Hapenigukosi muntu gwa kukala pampindi pa shiti sha shifalumi sha Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />Kumbiti gwenga ama wana gwaku pamgalambuka na kuleka kumfata, pamzikola ndiri amuli zaneni na malongulera ganiwapananiti, pamgenda kuwatendera wamlungu wamonga na kuwaguwira, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />su, haniwahamisiyi wantu waneni, Israeli, kulawa isi ayi yeni nuwapananiti, ntambu iraayi na numba ayi yeni niyilumika kwajiri ya litawu lyaneni, haniyasiri patali naneni na kuyitenda shintu sha kujongerwa na kubeziwa muwamu mwa maisi goseri. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Na Numba ayi hayibomoki na iweri mahami, kila yakapita pakwegera hakasintuki na kutikisiya mtuwi, na kukosiya, ntambu gaa Mtuwa Mlungu katenda hangu kwa isi ayi na kwa numba ayi? <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Wantu wavuwa hawankuli, toziya wamlekiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu, yakawalaviyiti wambuyi wawu muisi ya Misri, walikolelana na wamlungu wamonga, wawaguwira na kuwatendera, hangu, Mtuwa Mlungu kawajegera madoda goseri aga.”<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani kankumpanana Hiramu miji ishilini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Shakapanu vinja ishilini pavipititi kala, Selemani kanyawiti numba mbili zilii. Numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na liboma, <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />Mfalumi Selemani kamupananiti Hiramu mfalumi gwa Tiru, miji ishilini mumkowa gwa Galilaya toziya Hiramu ayu kaweriti kamjegera Selemani mbawu za miyerezi na mibereshi, na zahabu viraa, ntambu yakafiriti kwa kunyawira. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Kumbiti Hiramu pakasokiti kulawa Tiru na kuyiwona miji ayi yakaweriti kapananwa na Selemani kafiliziwa ndiri nayi. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Su, kamkosiya Selemani, “Mlongu gwaneni, ndo miji gaa ayi yeni gumpanana?” Ayi ndo toziya miji ishemwa isi ya Kabuli mpaka leru. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Hiramu kaweriti kamjegera mfalumi Selemani zahabu kilu elufi masheshi.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu gamonga ga Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Mfalumi Selemani ntambu yakawatendiziyiti wantu lihengu lya kukakaniziwa kunyawa numba ya Mlungu na liboma lyakuyi, kubamandira litapaka aku Milu na shibambaza sha Yerusalemu, na viraa kunyawa syayi miji ya Hasori na Megidu na Gezeri. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Gezeri ndo mji gweni Farao gwa Misri, kaweriti kagulopola, kagukankala mji gwa Gezeri na kugulunguziya motu, na kawalaga Wakanaani, wenikaya wakuyi. Shakapanu mhinga gwa Falawu pakayugitwi na Selemani, mfalumi gwa Misri kampananiti mhinga gwakuyi mji agu gwa Gezeri guweri lifupu lya ndowa. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Na Selemani kagunyawiti syayi mji gwa Gezeri. Ntambu iraayi kanyawiti Beti Horoni ya pasi, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />ntambu iraayi miji yayifata. Baalati, na Tamari, mji guweriti kushidowi muisi ya Yuda, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />kanyawa miji yakuwi yoseri ya luhanja, kanyawa miji ya kutula mbutuka zakuyi za kukwegwa, na kanyawa miji ya kutula farasi wakuyi, viraa shoseri shakafiriti kunyawa Muyerusalemu, Lebanoni na muisi yoseri muukolamlima wakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Wantu wamonga woseri yawasigariti muwamu mwa Waamori na Wahiti na Waperezi na Wahivi na Wayebusi, woseri awa wawera ndiri wa Waisraeli. <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />Pamuhera na wiwuka wawu weni Waisraeli waweza ndiri kuwahowiziya nakamu, Selemani kawatendiziya lihengu lya kukakanika mpaka leru. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Kumbiti pakati pa Waisraeli, Selemani kamtendera ndiri muntu yoseri kaweri mmanda, womberi ndo waweriti wamashonta, wantumini wakuyi, makamanda wakuyi, wakulu wakuyi, wakamanda wa mbutuka zyakuwi za kukwegwa na wakwena farasi wakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Ayi ndo walanga ya maafisa wakulu yawaweriti walolera wa lihengu lya Selemani. Wantu miya mhanu na amsini, awa ndo yawagolokiriti wantu yawatenditi lihengu.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Shakapanu mhinga Falawu kahamiliti mji gwa Dawudi, kagenda kulikala munumba yakuyi Selemani kamnyawiliti, shakapanu Selemani kabamandira shibambaza aku Milu.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Mala ndatu kila vinja, Selemani kalaviyiti tambiku za kulunguziwa na tambiku za ponga pampindi pa shitalawanda shakaweriti kamnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu, kamtumiziya ubani Mtuwa Mlungu, viraa kayimaliriti numba.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Mfalumi Selemani kanyawiti melikebu zivuwa aku Esioni Geberi, pakwegera na Eloti yaiwera kupwani ya Bahari ya Shamu, muisi ya Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Mfalumi Hiramu kawatuma wantu yawamana lihengu lya mumeli pamuhera na wantumintumi wa Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Wagendi mwanja kuisi ya Ofiri, na kutola zahabu kulawa aku, wamjegera mfalumi Selemani shiyasi sha kilu elufu lilongu na msheshi.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Malikiya gwa Sheba kankumtyangira Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Mirandu 9:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Malikiya gwa Sheba pakapikaniriti zyuma za Selemani toziya ya litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, kamgenderiti selemani su kumjera kwa makosiwu makamala. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Kasokiti Yerusalemu pakawera kalilonguziya na mwanja gwa wantu wavuwa nentu pamuhera na ngamiya yawapapiti utuli, na zahabu ivuwa nentu, mabuwi ga beyi nkulu, pakasokiti kwa Selemani, kayowenaliti nayu makosiwu goseri gakaweriti naga. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Selemeni kagankula makosiyu goseri, paweriti ndiri likosiwu lyoseri lyakalisinditi. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Malikiya gwa Sheba kalikangashiti nentu pakavimaniti luhala loseri lya Selemani, na liboma lyakaweriti kayinyawa, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />kayi pakawoniti shiboga shashijengitwi pameza pakuwi, wakulu wakuyi ntambu yawalikaliti pameza na ntambu wantumintumi yawatenderiti na yawavaliti, viraa watendera wakuyi na tambiku za kulunguziwa zeni kazilaviyiti munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, kakapa na kulikangasha nentu. <verse eid="1KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Kamgambira Mfalumi, “Mirandu yoseri yampikiniriti kuisi yangu na lihengu lyaku na luhala lyaku ndo nakaka! <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Kumbiti weza ndiri kwamini visoweru avi mpaka pansokiti na kulilorera namweni. Kumbiti ng'ambirwa ndiri ata nusu yakuyi, luhala lyakuyi na mpatiru zaku vipita visoweru vyampatiti. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Wantu waku wawera na nemeleru! Wantumintumi waku wawera na nemeleru yawakutedera mashaka goseri na kupikanira luhala lwaku! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Kazyumwi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, mweni kafiliziwa na gwenga, kakutula pampindi pa shiti sha ukulu sha Israeli! Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kayifiriti Israeli mashaka goseri, kakutula gwenga guweri mfalumi, su gwendelezi toza na njira ya kumfiliziya Mlungu.”<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Shakapanu malikiya kampanana Mfalumi mafupu ga kilu elufi msheshi nentu ga zahabu, shiyasi shikulu sha utuli na mabuwi ga beyi nkulu. Utuli shiyasi shikulu handa ashi shakampananiti mfalumi Selemani ashenipati nakamu kujegwa kayi.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />Kayi mwanja gwa meli za Hiramu gujengiti zahabu kulawa Ofiri, gujega kwa kuvuwa mitera ya msandali na mabuwi ga beyi nkulu. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Mfalumi kayitenderiti mitera ayi ya msandali kwajili ya vikololeru vya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, na za liboma na viraa kwa kunyawira talumbeta na lugombugombu lya wayimba. Mitera ya msandali handa ayi ayeniwoneki kayi mpaka leru.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Mfalumi Selemani kamupananiti malikiya gwa Sheba kila shintu shakaluwiti na shakafira, pamuhera na vintu vimonga vyeni Selemani kamupananiti kulawirana na ukalamuka wakuyi wa shifalumi. Su, malikiya kawuya kuisi kwakuyi pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulunda wa Mfalumi Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Kila shinja Mfalumi Selemani kankiti zahabu kilu elufu ishilini na tatu. <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />Shiyasi ashi sha zahabu pamuhera ndiri na zahabu yakapatiti kwa wawuza vintu na washuuzi, kwa wafalumi woseri wa Arabia na wakulu wa mikoa ya Israeli.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Mfalumi Selemani kanyawiti ngawu nkulu miya mbili kwa zahabu yaiponditwi, kila ngawu yimu yingiliti kilu saba za zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Kanyawiti ngawu ndidikandidika miya tatu kwa zahabu yaiponditwi, kila ngawu kilu yimu na nusu, shakapanu mfalumi kazitula mulijengu lyalishemitwi Numba ya Lidowi lya Lebanoni.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Viraa kanyawiti shiti sha shifalumi shikulu kwa magoli ga ndembu, kashigibikira kwa zahabu iyerepa nentu. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Shiti ashi shiweriti na ngweneru sita. Seemu ya pampindi iweriti pabiringitwi na kutuluwa pahali pa kwegemera liwoku wega zyakuwi mbili na vinyagu vya simba viwili vigoloka shimu pambwega pa pahali panu pa kwegemera liwoku. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Kuweriti viraa na vinyagu lilongu na mbili vya simba vigoloka, shimu upeleru wa kila lukweneru. Shiti handa ashi hasheni nyawilwi muufalumi woseri ulii.<verse eid="1KI 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Vyombu vyoseri vya kulandira vya mfalumi Selemani viweriti vya zahabu na vyombu vyoseri vyaviweriti Munumba ya lidowi lya Lebanoni viweriti vya zahabu iyerepa, kwahera shashinyawitwi kwa madini ga feza geni madini ga feza gaweriti ndiri shintu shaka ashi. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Toziya mfalumi Selemani kaweriti na mwanja gwa meli za Talishishi zyaziweriti zamwanja pamuhera na meli za Hiramu, kila shinja sha tatu meli azi za Talishishi zimujegiliti mfalumi zahabu, feza na magoli ga ndembu, mayani na tawusi. <verse eid="1KI 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Hangu, mfalumi Selemani kawapititi wafalumi woseri pasipanu kwa ulunda na luhala. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Wantu wa isi zoseri waweriti na matamata ya kumgendera Selemani su kupikanira luhala lwakuwi lweni Mlungu kampanana. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Kila yumu gwawu kamjegiriti lifupu, vyombu vya feza, na vya zahabu na nguwu na manimani na viwungu na farasi punda na. Mafupu aga gangitwi kila shinja.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Selemani kajojoniriti mbutuka za farasi na wakwena farasi na kaweriti na mbutuka za farasi elufu yimu na miya msheshi na wakwena farasi elufu lilongu na mbili weni kawatuliti mumiji imonga yana vituwu vya mbutuka za farasi, aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Su, mfalumi Selemani kagatenditi madini ga feza aku Yerusalemu kuwera shintu ntambu iraa handa mabuwi na mbawu za miyerezi ziweriti zivuwa handa mbawu za mikuyu ya aku Shefera. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Selemani kalagaliriti farasi kulawa Misri na viraa kulawa Kilikiya kweni washuuzi waweriti wawuzirwa na wantu wa Kilikiya. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Mbutuka yimu ya kukwegwa iweziti kuhemelwa aku Misri kwa feza yaiwera kilu saba na farasi yumu kaweza kuhemerwa feza kilu mbili. Viraa washuuzi wa mfalumi waweriti mumwanja gwa mbutuka na farasi awa na kuwawuzira wafalumi woseri wa Wahiti na Wasiriya.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Selemani kankumgalambuka Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Mfalumi Selemani kafiliti wadala wavuwa washiyenga. Mhinga gwa Falawu, wadala wa Mowabu na Amoni na Edomu na Sidoni na Wahiti, <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Wadala wa maisi geni Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kawabera Waisraeli pakalonga, “Namyuga kwawomberi pota womberi nawayuga kwamwenga toziya wadala awa hawapotoziyi miyoyu yamwenga su muwatenderi wamlungu wawu.” Selemani kawera nawa kwa kawafiriti wadala awa. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Selemani kaweriti na wadala miya saba, woseri wahinga wa shifalumi na wabimdogu miya tatu. Wadala awa wamgalambula moyu, <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Toziya pakaweriti mzewi, wadala wakuyi wamgalambula moyu ata kawatendera wamlungu wamonga, kuwera ndiri mwaminika nakamu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi handa Dawudi ntambu yakaweriti mwaminika. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Selemani kamgendiriti Ashataroti yakaweriti mlungu mdala yakaweriti gwa Wasidoni na kamfatiti Moleki mlungu likaliziwu lwa Waamoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Hangu Selemani katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kamfata ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu kwa waminika handa tati gwakuyi Dawudi ntambu yakatenditi. <verse eid="1KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Kulugongu yaluwera kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yerusalemu, Selemani kamnyawiliti pahala pa kumtambikira Kemoshi, mlungu yakakalaziya gwa Wamowabu, na pahala pa kumtambikira moreki mkalaziya gwa Mlungu, mlungu gwa Waamoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Ntambu iraayi kawanyawiriti wadala wakuyi woseri wa shihenga pahali pa kutumiziya ubani na kuwatambikira wamlungu wawu.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kamkalaliriti Selemani, toziya kaweriti kamleka Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, tembera yomberi kaweriti kamlawira mala mbili, <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />kumgambira nakawaguwira wamlungu wa shihenga, Selemani kajimiriti ndiri shakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Selemani, “Toziya gwamuwa kutenda hangu, gulimega lipatanu lyangu na gwenga na kulema amuli zyangu zyanakupananiti, nakaka hanikupoki ukolamlima awu na kumpanana ntumintumi gwaku. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Ata hangu toziya ya tati gwaku Dawudi, hapeni ndendi hangu mumakaliru gaku, su haniupapuli ukolamlima awu mmawoku mwa mwana gwaku. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Ata yomberi hapeni nimpoki ukolamlima woseri, su hanimlekeri mwana gwaku likabira limu, toziya ya ntumintumi gwaku Dawudi, na toziya ya mji gwa Yerusalemu gweni nigusyagula guweri gwaneni.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wankondu wa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenda Hadadi yakaweriti gwa lukolu lwa mfalumi gwa Edomu, kaweri mnkondu gwa Selemani.<verse eid="1KI 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Shaka Dawudi pakawagamiziyiti Waedomu, Yoabu mkulu gwa shonta lya Dawudi, kagenditi aku kuwafintira yawalangitwi. Yoabu kawalagiti wapalu woseri wa Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yoabu kalikariti aku na wamashonta wakuyi kwa shaka sha miyezi sita, kaweriti kawagamiziya nakamu wapalu woseri wa Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Kumbiti Hadadi shaka ashi kaweriti mntemba katolikiriti Misri pamuhera na Waedomu wamu, wantumintumi wa tati wakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Hadadi na wayaguwi wagenditi mwanja kulawa Midiyani, wawatoriti wantu wamonga aku Parani, wagenda nawu mpaka Misri, kwa Falawu mfalumi gwa isi ayi. Falawu kampanana Hadadi litapaka na numba, kawalagalira wantumintumi wakuyi waweri wampanani shiboga. <verse eid="1KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Falawu kafiriziyitwi nentu na Hadadi. Hangu Falawu kamjimira shemeji gwakuyi, mpusu gwa malikiya Tepenesi, kayugwi na Hadadi. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Dada ayu gwa Tapenesi kamlelera Hadadi mwana yakashemitwi Genubati. Genubati kaleliritwi na Tapenese munumba ya Falawu, pamuhera na wana wa mfalumi.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Kumbiti Hadadi pakapikaniriti aku Misri handa Dawudi na Yoabu mkulu gwa mashonta, waweriti wahowa, kamgambiriti Falawu, “Gunjimiri mbuyi muisini yangu.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Kumbiti Falawu kamkosiya, “Nikunyima shishi ata gwamuyi vinu kuwuya muisini yaku?” Na Hadadi kalonga, “Gundeki mbuyi ukaya.”<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Viraa virii, Mlungu kamtenda Rezoni mwana gwa Eliyada, kaweri mnkondu gwa Selemani. Rezoni kaweriti kamtoloka mtuwa gwakuyi, mfalumi Hadadezeri gwa Soba. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Pa Dawudi kutenda malaga aku Soba, Rezoni kajojoniriti wantu na kushinyawa shipinga sha kumgalambuka mfalumi, na yomberi kaweri mlonguziya gwawu. Su, wagenda Damasiko, walikala aku na kumtenda Rezoni mfalumi gwa Damasiko. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Rezoni kaweriti mnkondu gwa Waisraeli shaka shoseri sha ukolamlima wa Selemani, kamgaziya nentu Selemani handa na yomberi Hadadi ntambu yakamgaziyiti. Su, Rezoni kayibeziti Israeli, na yomberi kakolitimlima isi ya Aramu.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shakatakuliti Mlungu kwa Yoribowamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Yoribowamu mwana gwa Nebati, Mwefraimu gwa Sereda, ntumintumii gwa Selemani, mawu gwakuwi kaweliti mkenja, yawamshemiti Zeruya, viraa kamgalambukiti mfalumi Dawudi. <verse eid="1KI 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Toziya ya ugalambuka ndo awu. Selemani pakaweriti kankutendelera na kunyawa seemu ya Milu na kubambandira shibambaza sha mji gwa tati gwakuyi Dawudi, <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Yorobowamu kawonikaniti mndemba mgangamala na shikambaku. Ndo Selemani pakawoniti handa mndemba ayu kaweriti muntu gwa mahengu, kamtula kaweri mgolokera gwa lihengu lya wantu wa makabila ga manasi na Efurayimu. <verse eid="1KI 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Lishaka limu, Yerobowamu pakaweriti pakagenda mwanja kulawa Yerusalemu, mbuyi gwa Mlungu Ahiya gwa Shiru kaliwoniti na yomberi mnjira. Ahiya kaweriti kavala lihabiti ya syayi. Woseri wawili waweriti gweka yawu mmalambu. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Katepu Ahiya, kalivula lihabiti lyakuyi ya syayi, kalidenganga vipandi lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Shakapanu kamgambira Yerobowamu, “Guvitoli vipandi lilongu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kalonga hangu, 'Guloli, pakwegera haniupapulangi ufalumi na kuwusiya mumawoku mwa Selemani, naneni hanikupanani gwenga makabila lilongu. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Kumbiti yomberi hanimlekeri likabira limu toziya ya ntumintumii gwangu Dawudi, toziya ya mji gwa Yerusalemu gweni nigusyagula kulawa mumakabira goseri ga Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Handendi hangu toziya Selemani kandeka, kaguwira wamlungu wamonga wa shihenga, Ashataroti mlungu mdala gwa Wasidoni, Kemosi mlungu gwa Wamowabu na Milikomu mlungu gwa Waamoni. Selemani kang'alambuka, katenda makontola palongolu paneni, na pota kujimira malagalira gangu handa Dawudi tati gwakuyi ntambu yakatenditi. <verse eid="1KI 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />Ata hangu, hapeni nimupoki ukolamlima woseri, ila hanimtendi kuwera mkolamlima toziya tati gwakuyi Dawudi kafatiti lagalira lyaneni na mlonguziwu gwaneni. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Kumbiti hanimpoki mwana gwakuyi ufalumi awu, naneni hanikupanani gwenga Yerobowamu makabira lilongu. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Ayu mwana gwakuyi Selemani hanimlekeri likabira limu, su shaka shoseri mwiwuka gwa ntumintumii gwangu Dawudi kaweri kankukolamlima Yerusalemu, kaweri lumulika lyalumulika palongolu paneni mumji gweni nigusyagula guweri pahali pa kung'uwira. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Su, gwenga Yoroboamu, hanikutendi guweri mfalumi gwa Israeli, na gwenga hagukolimlima ntambu yagufira. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Na handa pagutenda goseri hanikugambiri, handa hagulikali kulinganira na mafiliru ganeni, handa pagutenda maheri palongolu paneni kwa kukola malonguziya ganeni na malagalira gangu, handa ntumintumi gwaneni Dawudi ntambu yakatenditi, neni haweri pamuhera na gwenga mashaka goseri. Na hanikupanani isi ya Israeli na kuutenda ukolamlima waku uweri ugangamala ntambu yanimtendiriti Dawudi. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Toziya ya aga, haniwakomangi wiwuka wa Dawudi, kumbiti shaka shoseri ndiri.”<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Hangu Selemani kajeriti kumlaga Yorobowamu, kumbiti Yerobowamu katugira Misri kwa Shishaki mfalumi gwa Misri, kalikala aku mpaka Selemani pakahowiti.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Mirandu imonga ya Selemani, goseri kagatenditi na luhala lyakuyi, galembwa Mushitabu sha matendu ga Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Kwa shaka sha vinja alubayini, Selemani kakolitimlima isi yoseri ya Israeli, aku liboma lyakuyi liweriti Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Upeleru Selemani kahowiti, kafindirwa kumji gwa Dawudi. Rehobowamu mwana gwakuyi Selemani, kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Ugalambuka wa makabila ga kushana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">2 Mirandu 10:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Su Rehobowamu kagenda Shekemu, kweni Waisraeli woseri waweriti wajojonika su kumlumika kaweri mfalumi. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Na Yerobowamu mwana gwa Nebeti pakapatiti shisoweru kuusu shitendu ashi toziya kaweriti kankali Misri kweni kagenditi pakamtiriti Selemani, kawuyiti kulawa Misri. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Kumbiti Waisraeli watumiti ulagilagi na kumshema yerubowamu. Yomberi pamuhera na shipinga shoseri sha Israeli wamgenderiti Rehobowamu na wamgambira, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“Tati gwaku katupananiti lihengu likamala. Su gutupunguliri lihengu ali, na twenga hatukutenderi.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Na Rehoboamu kawagambira, “Mgendi, mwuyi kwaneni pa mashaka matatu.” Su, wawuka. <verse eid="1KI 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Shakapanu mfalumi Rehobowamu kafiliti kuvimana ntambu yawalonga wazeyi yawaweriti watakuziya wa tati gwakuyi Selemani, pakaweriti kankali mkomu kawakosiya, “Hashi mntakuziya niwapanani lyakulu gaa wantu awa?” <verse eid="1KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Wazeyi awa wamwankula, “Leru paguwera ntumintumi gwa wantu awa, paguwatendera na kuyowera na womberi weri paguwankula, panu hawaweri wantumintumi wa gwenga mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Kumbiti Rehoboamu kazalawiti litakulu lya wazewi, shakapanu katakulirana na wantemba wa ukulu wakuyi weni waweriti watakula wakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Su, kawakosiya, “Mwenga mlaviya utakula gaa su tuwezi kuwankula wantu awa yawang'ambira, niwapunguliri mahengu gakamala geni tati gwangu kawapananiti?” <verse eid="1KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Wantemba awa wamwankula, “Wantu awa yawakugambiriti tati gwaku kawapananiti lihengu likamala, wakuluwa guwapunguliri mahengu aga, gwenga guwagambiri hangu, shala sha neni shididini ndo shinenepa nentu kuliku shunu sha tati gwangu. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Kagatenditi makaliru genu gakamala na neni hanuwatendi makaliru genu gakamala, kumbiti lihengu lyangu nentu. Tati gwangu kawakomangiti kwa ndomondu, kumbiti neni haniwakomangi kwa ndomondu yana misontu.”<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Su, lishaka lya tatu Yerobowamu pamuhera na wantu woseri wawuya kwa Rehobowamu ntambu yakaweriti kawalagalira. <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Mfalumi kawankula wantu awa kwa kukalipa, kalibeziyiti litakulu lyakapananitwi na wazewi. <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />Kafata litakulu lya wantemba wayaguyi, kawagambira, “Tati gwangu kagatenda makaliru genu gaweri makamala, na neni hanigatendi gaweri makamala nentu. Tati gwangu kawakomanga kwa ndomondu, kumbiti neni hanuwakomangi kwa ndomondu zyana misontu.” <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Hangu, mfalumi kawashera ndiri wantu toziya mlandu agu gutenditwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, su kutenda shisoweru shakuwi shakamgambiriti Yerobowamu mwana gwa Nebati, kwa njira ya Ahiya kulawa mji gwa Shilu.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Kumbiti wantu woseri wa Israeli pawawoniti handa mfalumi kawashera ndiri, wamgambiriti. “Twahara shoseri shilii na Dawudi! Twahera shoseli shili kulawa mwana gwa Yese. Muwuyi ukaya mwenga wantu wa Israeli! Guyiloleri numba yaku gamweni gwee Dawudi.” Hangu wantu wa Israeli wawuya ukaya kwawu. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Wantu wa Israeli yawaweriti wankulikala mumiji ya Yuda, ndo awa hera wawasigaliti pasi pa ukolamlima wa Rehobowamu.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Mfalumi Rehobowamu pakamtumiti Adoramu, yakaweriti mgolokera mkulu gwa lihengu lya kukakaniziwa, wantu woseri wa Israeli wamguma mabuwi wamlaga. Na Rehobowamu kakweniti kalongola mumbutuka yakuwi ya kukwegwa na farasi, katugira Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Hangu wantu wa Israeli waweriti walekana na numba ya lukolu lwa Dawudi mpaka leru.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Wantu woseri wa Israeli pawapatiti shisoweru handa Yerobowamu kaweriti kawuya kulawa Misri, wamshemiti mukuliwona paweru, wamtenda kaweri mfalumi gwa Israeli yoseri. Kwahera likabira limonga lyaliweriti pamuhera na lukolu lwa Dawudi ira hera likabira lya Yuda.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umbuyi wa Shemaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Rehobowamu pakasokiti Yerusalemu, kawajojonira wamashota wagangamala laki yimu na elufu semanini wa makabira ga Yuda na ga Benjamini, kapati kulikomanga na ukolamlima wa Israeli, su kawuziyi ukolamlima kwakuyi Rehobowamu, mwana gwa Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Kumbiti ulagilagi wa Mlungu umwiziriti Shemaya, muntu gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />“Gumgambiri Rehobowamu mwana gwa Selemani, mfalumi gwa Yuda, na wantu woseri wa likabira lya Yuda na Benjamini na wantu wamonga. <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />Neni Mtuwa Mlungu nonga hangu, namgenda, kulikomanga na walongu wenu wantu wa Israeli. Mwuyi kila muntu ukaya kwakuyi, toziya aga yagalawiliti ndo mpangu gwaneni.” Su wafati ulagilagi awu wa Mtuwa Mlungu wawuya ukaya handa Mlungu ntambu yakawalagaliriti.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yerubowamu kankumgalambuka Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Shakapanu mfalumi Yerobowamu kagunyawa syayi mji gwa Shekemu kulugongu lwa Efraimu, kalikala aku. Shakapanu kagenda kunyawa mji gwa Penueli. <verse eid="1KI 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Yerobowamu ndo kanja kuliholahola, “Vinu ufalumi hauwuyi kwa kaya ya mfalumi Dawudi. <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />Handa wantu awa pawendereya kugenda kutambika munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu aku Yerusalemu. Miyoyu yawu hayimgalambukiri mtuwa gwawu Rehobowamu mfalumi gwa Yuda, na womberi hawantagi neni na kumwuyira mfalumi Rehobowamu.”<verse eid="1KI 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Su, pa kuligambiziyana na wamonga, kanyawa vinyagu vya wana wa ng'ombi viwili vya zahabu. Shakapanu kawagambira wantu, “Mweliti mwankugenda Yerusalemu kumguwila kwa shaka shitali. Awa ndo wamlungu wenu yawawalaviyiti muisi ya misri.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Kashituliti shinyagu shimu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi gwa zahabu mjini Beteli, na sha pili mjini Dani. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Mlandu agu guwera vidoda, toziya wantu wagenditi kuvitambikira vinyagu avi na wagenditi kutali nentu aku Dani. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Viraa virii Yerobowamu kanyawiti pahala pampindi pa kutambikira, kawasyagula watambika, wantu yawawera ndiri wa lukolu lwa Lawi. <verse eid="1KI 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Yerubowamu, viraa kalagalira lishaka lya lilongu na mhanu lya mwezi gwa nani, guweri msambu teratera na msambu gulii yaguweriti aku Yuda. Kushitalawanda shashinyawitwi aku Beteli kulongolu kwa vinyagu vya mwana gwa ng'ombi vyakanyawiti, katula watambika walii yawasyagulitwi watenderi kila pahala pa kulavilira tambiku pawanyawiti pahala pampindi. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Lishaka ali lya lilongu na mhanu lya mwezi gwa nani, kalituliti mweni, na yomberi kagenda Beteli kutambikira. Ntambu yakalagaliriti msambu agu yakagutuliti toziya ya wantu wa Israeli, na mweni kakwena kushigendera shitalawanda, kutumiziya ubani.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="s">Mbuyi gwa Mlungu kapangira guwira aku Bateli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Lishaka limu Yerubowamu kaweriti kagoloka pambwega pa shitalawanda kutumiziyi ubani. Su, muntu gwa Mlungu kulawa Yuda kasoka Beteli katumitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Muntu ayu kashipangira kwa lagiru lya Mlungu pakalonga, “Gwee shitalawanda! Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Hakiwuki mwana mulukolu lwa Dawudi, litawu lyakuyi Yosiya. Ayu hakawatoli watambika yawatendera pahala pa pampindi na kutambika pampindi paku, yina, mifupa ya wantu hayilunguziwi pampindi paku!” <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Na mbuyi gwa Mlungu kalaviya lirangaliru lishaka liraalirii, pakalonga, “Hali ndo liragaliru lyakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu. Shitalawanda ashi hashibomoki, na malivu yagawera pampindi pakuyi hagitiki.”<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Mfalumi Yerobowamu pakapikaniriti visoweru avi vya muntu gwa Mlungu kuusu shitalawanda aku Beteli, katalipisiyiti liwoku pakalonga, “Mmubati muntu ayu!” Katepu liwoku ali lyakalitalapisiyiti kwa muntu ayu, liyuma, kaweziti ndiri kayi kulipinda. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Shitalawanda ashi shibomoka na malivu gakuyi gitika pasi, handa lirangaliru lilii lyakalaviyiti muntu gwa Mlungu na shisoweru sha Mlungu. <verse eid="1KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Su, mfalumi Yerobowamu kamgambira mbuyi gwa Mlungu, “Shondi, gumgambiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, gunduwiri liwoku lyangu liponi.” Na mbuyi gwa Mlungu kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu, na liwoku lya Mfalumi lipona, liwuyira ntambu yakuyi handa kwanja. <verse eid="1KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Mfalumi kamgambira muntu gwa Mlungu, “Gwizi ukaya kwaneni gwakaliyi shiboga, naneni hanikupanani lifupu.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Kumbiti muntu gwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Ata handa pagumpanana nusu ya ulunda waku, hapening'endi pamuhera na gwenga. Hapeni ndiyi pota kulanda mashi ga pahala panu, <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti hapeni ndiyi shiboga ama kulanda mashi, pota nawuya njira iraairii yanfatiti kwiza panu.” <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Su, muntu ayu kagenda zakuwi, pota kawuyira kayi ndiri njira ilii yakaziriti Beteri.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuyi gwa Mlungu mzewi gwa Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Shaka ashi, paweriti na mbuyi gwa Mlungu yumu mzewi aku Beteli. Wana wakuwi wamgendera, wamgambira mirandu yoseri yakatenditi yulii muntu gwa Mlungu lishaka ali, aku Beteli wamgambira viraa visoweru vya muntu ulii yakamgambiriti mfalumi Yerubowamu. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Tati gwawu kawakosiya, “Kapita njira yoshi?” Na womberi wamlanguziya njira yakapititi ulii muntu gwa Mlungu kulawa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Na yomberi kawagambira wana wakuyi, “Mnyalikiri punda ayu.” Na womberi wamyalikira punda, na mzewi kakwena pampindi pakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />Kamfata muntu gwa Mlungu uliii, kamwona kalivaga pasi pa mtera gwa mwaloni. Su, kamkosiya, “Hashi gwenga ndo yulii muntu gwa Mlungu kulawa Yuda?” Na yomberi kamwankula, “Yina! Ndo neni.” <verse eid="1KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Mzewi ulii kamgambira, “Gwizi ukaya kwaneni, gukaliyi shiboga.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Kumbiti yomberi kamgambira, “Meza ndiri kuwuya pamuhera na gwenga, pota kwingira ukaya kwaku. Meza ndiri kuliya shiboga ama kulanda mashi pahala panu, <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti nandiya shiboga ama kulanda mashi pahala panu, nambuya kwa njira yaniziriti.”<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Mzeyi ayu gwa Beteli kamgambira, “Neni viraa ndo mbuyi gwa Mlungu gambira gwenga, na Mtuwa Mlungu kayowera naneni kwa njira ya ntumintumi gwa kumpindi pakalonga, gumwuziyi ukaya kwaku, kaliyi shiboga na kulanda mashi.” Kumbiti mbuyi ayu gwa Mlungu mzewi kaweriti kankumpayira hera. <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Su, muntu gwa Mlungu kawuya pamuhera na yomberi, kaliya shiboga na kulanda mashi kwa mzewi ayu. <verse eid="1KI 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Pawaweriti wankuliya, shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shimwizira ayu mbuyi gwa Mlungu mzewi, <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />na yomberi kamgambira kwa liziwu ayu muntu gwa Mlungu kulawa Yuda, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Gwenga guleka kujimira ulagilagi wa Mtuwa Mlungu, gwenga gufata ndiri lagalira yakakupananiti Mtuwa Mlungu. Mlungu gwaku. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Badala yakuyi, guwuya panu, guliya shiboga na kulanda mashi pahala panu peni gugambiritwi naguliya shiboga pota kulanda mashi. Su, nshimba yaku hapeni gufindilwi kulisembi lya wambuyi waku.”<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Pawamaliriti kuliya, mbuyi ayu gwa Mlungu mzewi kamyakila punda ayu muntu gwa Mlungu, na yomberi kawuka. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Pakaweriti kankugenda zakuyi, simba kaliwona nayi mnjira, kamlaga, nshimba yakuwi iweri iyaswa panu panjira, punda gwakuyi na simba ayu waweriti wagoloka pambwega pakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Wantu pawapititi panu na kugawona mawuti mnjira, na simba kagoloka pakwegera nayi, wagenda mpaka mjini mwakaweriti kankulikala yulii mbuyi gwa Mlungu, wawagambira wantu,<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Mbuyi yulii mweni kaweriti kamshemera ukaya kwakuwi pakapikaniriti shisoweru ashi, kalonga, “Ayu ndo ulaaurii muntu gwa Mlungu yakalemiti kujimira shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu kamtuma simba, kamkangala na kumlaga ntambu yakaweriti kamgambira.” <verse eid="1KI 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Panu kawagambira wana wakuyi, “Mnyalikiri punda.” Na womberi wamyalikira. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Mzewi uli kagenda, kagawona mauti ga muntu gwa Mlungu mnjira, simba na punda gwakuwi wapambwega pakuyi, simba ayu kagaliyiti ndiri mauti pota kamkangala punda. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Su, mbuyi gwa Mlungu mzewi ayu kagatola mauti ga muntu gwa Mlungu, kagatula pampindi pa punda gwakuyi, kagawuziya kumjini Beteli, kudayilira shiwembu shakuyi na kumfindira. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Su, kamfindira mulisembi lyakuyi, na yomberi pamuhera na wana wakuyi wadaya shiwembu shakuwi pawalonga, “Mbuyi! Mlongu gwangu!” <verse eid="1KI 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Pa kufindira, mbuyi kawagambira wana wakuwi, “Pahowa, mnfindiri mulisembi liraaali lyakafindilitwi muntu gwa Mlungu, myituli mifupa yaneni pambwega pa mifupa yakuwi. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Mirandu yoseri yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu toya ya shitalawanda sha Beteli, na pahala poseri pa kutambikira pahala pampindi pa miji gwa Samariya, nakaka hayilawiri.” <verse eid="1KI 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Mfalumi Yerubowamu kaleka ndiri madoda gakuyi, kendileyiti kusyagula wantu wa ntambu iraaayi waweri watambika, watenderi pahala pampindi pa kutambikira. Muntu yoseri yakatenditi lihengu mweni, kamsyaguliti kuwera mtambika gwa pahala pampindi pa kutambikira. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Shitendu ashi shiweriti shidoda toziya shilujegiliti lukolu lwa Yerubowamu luturwi kutali na kwagamiziwa.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Mwana gwa Yerubowamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Shaka ashi, Abiya mwana gwa mfalumi Yerubowamu, kawera mlweri. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Yerubowamu kamgambira mdala gwakuyi, “Gulipayiri kuwera yumonga, gugendi mjini Shilu kwakalikala mbuyi gwa Mlungu Ahiya yakalongiti handa neni haweri mfalumi gwa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Gumjegeri mabumunda lilongu, mandazi gamu, na lwashi supa yimu. Yomberi hakakungambiri yagafira kumpata mwana gwetu.”<verse eid="1KI 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Su, mdala gwakuyi Yerubowamu kawuka, kagenda Shilu ukaya kwa Ahiya. Shaka ashi, Ahiya kaweriti kaweza ndiri kayi kuwona weli toziya ya uzewi. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kamgambira Ahiya, mdala gwa Yerubowamu kaweriti mnjira, kankwiza kumkosiya yagafira kumpata mwana gwakuyi mlweri, na ntambu yakafira kumwankula, mdala gwakuyi Yerubowamu kalitenditi muntu gwingi.” <verse eid="1KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Kumbiti Ahiya pakampikaniriti kinginda ya magulu gakuyi kankwingira kuligomi, kalongiti, “Gwingili mnumba mdala gwa Yerubowamu. Kumbiti ntambu gaa gulipayira kuwera muntu yumonga? Ninawu ulagilagi uherepa ndiri kwagwenga! <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Gugendi gwakamgambiri Yerubowamu handa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli Kalonga hangu, nikusyaguliti muwamu mwa wantu, nikutenda kuwera mkulu gwa wantu waneni Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />Niupapula ufalumi kulawa kwa wiwuka wa Dawudi, nikupanana gwenga. Kumbiti gwenga guwera ndiri handa ntumintumi gwaneni Dawudi kazikoliti lagira zyangu kafata mafiliru gangu kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri na kutenda hera yagawera teratera palongolu pa masu ganeni. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Gwenga gutenda makontola nentu kuliku yawagatenditi walii yawakulongoliriti, gwenga gungalaziya kwa kulinyawira wamlungu wamonga na shinyagu sha kuponda, shakapanu gundeka. <verse eid="1KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />Aya su, vinu haniujegeri madoda wiwuka wakuyi, Yerubowamu, haniwalagi wana wapalu woseri wa Yerubowamu Muisraeli, kaweri mmanda ama lekeru. Wiwuka wakuyi woseri haniwalunguziyi handa muntu ntambu yakalunguziya mavi, mpaka gawuki. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Yoseri yakawera gwa wiwuka wa Yerubowamu yakahowera mjini ng'ang'a hawamliyi na yoseri yakahowera mlirambu na wampongu wa kuliyera hawamliyi. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu nonga!”<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />Ahiya kamgambira mdala gwakuyi Yerubowamu, “Aya gugoloki, gugendi zaku ukaya. Katepu hera pagwingira kumjini, mntemba gwaku hakahowi. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Wantu wa Israeli hawamliliri na kumfindira. Kumbiti, ndo ayu hera gwa wiwuka wa Yerubowamu hawamfindiri, toziya ndo yomberi hera gwa wiwuka wa Yerubowamu yakamfiliziyitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />Kayi leru ayi, Mtuwa Mlungu hakatuli mfalumi yumonga Muisraeli mweni hakauwagamiziyi kutali wiwuka ya Yerobowamu. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Yina, kwanjira vinu, Mtuwa Mlungu hakawakomi wantu wa Israeli, na womberi hawatikinyiki gambira ndundu itikisiwa kulushemba. Hakawatupuli kulawa isi ayi iyerepa yawapananitwi wambuyi wawu, na kuwapalasiya kutali, kumwambu kulushemba lwa Eufrati, toziya wamkalaziya Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kulinyawira shinyagu sha Ashera mlungu mdala. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakasi Israeli toziya ya vidoda vyakatenditi Yerubowamu, na kuwatenda wantu wa Israeli viraa watendi vidoda.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Panu, mdala gwakuyi Yerubowamu kawuka, kagenda mwanja mpaka Tiriza. Katepu hera pakasokiti paligomi lya numba, mwana kahowa.<verse eid="1KI 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Wantu woseri wa Israeli wamfindira na kumlilira ntambu yakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu, kwa njira ya mbuyi gwa Mlungu Ahiya, ntumintumi gwakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yerobowamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Matendu gamonga ga mfalumi Yerobowamu, ntambu yakalikomangiti nkondu na ntambu yakakolitimlima, goseri galembwa Mushitabu sha Mirandu ya shaka sha Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Yerobowamu kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja ishilini na mbili, shakapanu kahowa, na Nadabu, wana gwakuyi, kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yerobowamu gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Rehobowamu, mwana gwakuyi Selemani, kaweriti na vinja alubayini na yimu pakanjiti kukolamlima Yuda. Na yomberi kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja lilongu na saba Yerusalemu, mji gweni Mtuwa Mlungu kagusyaguliti muwamu mwa miji ya makabira goseri ga Israeli kaguwiri amu. Mawu gwa Rehobowamu kaweriti Naamu muntu kulawa Amoni. <verse eid="1KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Wantu wa Yuda watenditi madoda palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu. Wamkalaziya kwa vidoda vyawu vyawatenditi, zivuwa kuliku za wambuyi wawu. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Walinyawiriti viraa pahala pampindi pa kuguwira, vindwalingu vya mabuwi, na shinyagu sha Ashera, pampindi pa kila shigongu shitali na pasi pa kila mtera gwana mihamba miwisi. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Madoda nentu ya aga, kuweriti na wapalu na wadala yawatenda uhumba pahala panu pakuguwira wantu yawammana ndiri Mlungu, wantu yawatenditi matendu ga kukalaziya ga maisi geni Mlungu kagawingiti Muisraeli pawaweriti wankwingira muisi ya Kanani.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Mushinja sha mhanu sha ukolamlima wa Rehobowamu, Shishaki mfalumi gwa Misri, kagukomangiti mji gwa Yeusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Katola hanja zoseri za numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na za liboma, katoliti kila shintu, viraa katoliti ngawu zoseri za zahabu zyakanyawiti Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Badala ya ngawu azi, mfalumi Rehobowamu kanyawiti ngawu za shaba na kuzitula pasi pa ulolera wa wahepera ligomi lya liboma. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Kila shaka mfalumi pakagenditi munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, walolera wazipapiti ngawu azi, na shakapanu waziwuziya mushumba sha ulolera.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Matendu gamonga ga Mfalumi Rehobowamu, na goseri gakatenditi, galembitwi Mushitabu sha Mirandu ya shaka sha Wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Mashaka goseri kuweriti na nkondu pakati pa Rehobowamu na Yerobowamu. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Upeleru wakuyi, Rehobowamu kahowiti na kufindirwa kulisembi lya wazewi wakuyi, kumiji ya Dawudi. Mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Naama kulawa Amoni, na Abiyamu mwana gwakuyi kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Abiya gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 13:1-14:1">2 Mirandu 13:1-14:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Abiya kanjiti kukolamlima aku Yuda shinja sha lilongu na nane wa ukolamlima wa mfalumi Yerobowamu, mwana gwakuyi Nebari, <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />kakolitimlima kwa vinja vitatu pakawera Yerusalemu. Mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Maaka mhinga gwa Abisalomu, <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Abiya katenditi vidoda viraa virii vyakatenditi tati gwakuwi, pota kuwera na moyu mwaminika kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi, ntambu yakaweriti tati gwakuyi Dawudi. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Kumbiti ata hangu, toziya ya Dawudi, Mlungu kamupananiti mwana hakakolamlima pa yomberi, kaweri limuliku lya kulangalira Yerusalemu na kuugangamaziya mji gwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Mlungu katenda hangu toziya Dawudi katenditi maheri palongolu pakuyi na kamfata ntambu yakamlagaliriti Mtuwa Mlungu mashaka gakuyi goseri, ilahera lilii likosa lya Uria muntu kulawa Hiti. <verse eid="1KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Kuweriti nkondu pakati pa Rehobowamu na Yerobowamu yendereyiti shaka shoseri sha ukomu wa Abiya. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Na matendu gamonga ga Abiya na goseri kagatenditi galembitwi mushitabu sha Mirandu ya shaka sha wafalumi wa Yuda. Abiya na Yerobowamu walikaliti kwa ntambu ya nkondu. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Abiya kahowiti na kufindilwa mumji gwa Dawudi na mwana gwakuyi Asa kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asa mfalumi gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Mushinja sha ishilini sha ukolamlima wa Yerobowamu, mfalumi gwa Israeli, Asa kanjiti kukolamlima aku Yuda, <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />na kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja alubayini na yimu. Mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Maaka, mhinga gwa Abisalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Mfalumi Asa katenditi yagaweriti maheri palongolu pa Mlungu ntambu yakatenditi Dawudi mbuyi gwakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Kawawingiti walii yawatenditi uhumba pahala pa kuguwira, kaviwusiyiti vinyagu vyoseri vyeni wambuyi wakuyi waweriti wavinyawa. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Kamwusiyiti bibi gwakuwi Maaka, ukulu wakuyi wa mawu malikiya, toziya kanyawiti shinyagu sha Ashera, mlungu gwa shidala, na shinyagu ashi kashimegangameganga na kushilunguziya kululalanda lwa Kidironi. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Kumbiti pahala pampindi pa kutambikira pahalibisiwa ndiri, ata hangu, yomberi kaweriti na moyu mwaminika kwa Mtuwa Mlungu makaliru gakuyi goseri. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Kawuziyiti Munumba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, vintu vyoseri vyaviweriti vilumikwa na tati gwakuyi, pamuhera na virii vyakuyi mweni. Vintu vya madini ga feza, na vya zahabu na vintu vimonga<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Mfalumi Asa gwa Yuda na mfalumi Baasha gwa Israeli, waweriti na nkondu pakati pawu shaka shoseri pawaweriti wankukolamlima. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Baasha mfalumi gwa Israeli, kayikomangiti isi ya Yuda na kwanja kunyawa Rama su kubera muntu yoseri nakalawa pota kwingira kwa Asa, mfalmi gwa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Mfalumi Asa ndo katola madini ga feza na zahabu yoseri yayisigaliti muluhanja lwa Mtuwa Mlungu na muluhanja lya liboma kawapanana wantumintumi wakuyi, kawatuma Damasko kwa Beni Hadadi mwana gwa Tabirimoni, mzukulu gwa Hezioni, mfalumi gwa Aramu, pakalonga, <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />“Tutendi mapatanu ga kuwera pamuhera pakati paneni na gwenga ntambu yawatenditi tati gwangu na tati gwaku, guloli, nikujegera lifupu lya mpiya na zahabu, gugendi gwakawusiyi magambiziyanu ga kuwera pamuhera pakati paku na mfalumi Baasha gwa Israeli, su kaleki mankomangu neni.” <verse eid="1KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Panu mfalumi Beni Hadadi kamjimira shakamgambiriti mfalumi Asa, kawatuma wakulu wa shonta lyakuyi kugenda kuyikomanga miji ya Israeli. Na womberi wayitola Iyoni, na Dani na Abelibetimaaka na Kineroti yoseri, na isi yoseri ya Nafutali. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Mfalumi Baasha pakapatiti shisoweru sha makomangu aga kaleka kugunyawa mji gwa Rama kakuwuya kumji gwa Tiriza. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Mfalumi Asa ndo pakabweriti kwa wantu woseri wa Yuda, bila kumleka ata muntu yumu, wahamiziyi mabuwi ga Rama na mbawu, vintu vyeni Baasha kavitenderiti kunyawira. Shakapanu mfalumi Asa katenderiti vintu havi kunyawira mji gwa Geba mu Benjamini na Mizipa.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Matendu gamonga goseri ga Asa, ugangamala wakuyi na miji yoseri yakanyawiti, goseri yagalembitwi Mushitabu sha Mirandu ya shaka sha wafalumi wa Yuda. Kumbiti shaka sha uzewi wakuyi, Asa kakolitwi na ulweri wa magulu. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Shakapanu, Asa kahowiti, kafindirwa mumasembi ga shifalumi, Mumji gwa Dawudi na yomberi mwana gwakuyi Yehoshafati, kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nadamu mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Mushinja sha pili sha ukolamlima wa Asa aku Yuda, Nadabu mwana gwa Yorobowamu, kanjiti kukolamlima aku Israeli. Kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja viwili. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Nadabu katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kafata njira za tati gwakuyi mweni kawatenditi wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Baasha mwana gwa Ahiya, gwa likabira lya Isakari, katendera upyota Nadabu. Su, shaka Nadabu na shonta lyakuyi pawaweriti waguzyengeta mji gwa Gibetoni gwa Wafilisiti, Baasha kamkangala na kumlaga. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Kakolamlima pahala pakuyi, ashi shiweriti shinja sha tatu sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Asa gwa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Katepu hera pakanjiti kukolamlima, Baasha kawalaga wantu woseri wa kaya ya Yerubowamu, kawalekiti ndiri wakomu muntu yoseri gwa Yerubowamu, hangu iweriti ilinganira na galii kagalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu kwanjira ya ntumintumi gwakuyi, Ahiya gwa Shilu. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Mirandu ayi itendikiti toziya Yerobowamu kamkalaziyiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kwa vidoda vyakuwi na kuwatenda wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Matendu gamonga ga Nadabu, goseri galembitwi Mushitabu sha mirandu ya shaka sha Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Mfalumi Asa gwa Yuda na mfalumi Baasha gwa Israeli waweriti na nkondu pakati pawu shaka shoseri pawaweriti wankukolamlima.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baasha mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Mushinja sha tatu sha ukolamlima wa Asa mfalumi gwa Yuda, Baasha mwana gwa Ahiya, kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli kulawa Tiriza. Kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja ishilini na msheshi. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Baasha katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kafata njiira ya Yerobowamu na kutenda vidoda viraa virii vyeni kawatenditi wantu wa Israeli wavitendi.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shimwizira Yehu mwana gwa Hanani, kuusu Baasha, <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />“Gwenga Baasha, neni nikunyasuliti kulawa kumadikudiku, nikutenda mlonguziya gwa wantu waneni wa Israeli. Gwenga gufata matendu ga Yerubowamu, guwatenda wantu waneni Israeli watendi vidoda na kungalaziya kwa vidoda vyawu. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Aya! Vinu, hanikuwusiliri kutali gwenga na kaya yaku, haniwatenderi kaya yaku ntambu yanuwatendiriti kaya ya Yerubowamu mwana gwa Nebati. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Yoseri gwa kaya yaku yakahowera kumjini, wang'ang'a hawamliyi, na yoseri yakahowera mlilambu wambongu wa kundundu hawamliyi.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Matendu gamonga ga Baasha na ugangamala wakuyi, goseri galembitwi Mushitabu sha Mirandu ya shaka ya Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Upeleru, Baasha kahowiti, kafindilwa aku Tiriza, mwana gwakuyi Ela kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Kayi shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu kwa Baasha na kaya yakuyi, shimwiziriti Yehu mwana gwakuyi Hanani toziya ya makontola kagatenditi palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu. Baasha kamkalaziya Mtuwa Mlungu kwa matendu gakuyi, kafata matendu ga Yerobowamu na kayi wakuyi na kuijegera kaya wakuyi maagamiziya.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ela mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Mushinja sha ishilini na sita sha ukolamlima wa Asa mfalumi gwa Yuda, Ela mwana gwa Baasha, kanjiti kukolamlima aku Israeli kulawa Tiriza. Kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja viwili. <verse eid="1KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Ntumintumi gwakuyi Zimri kagolokeriti nusu ya shipinga sha mbutuka zyakuwi za kukwegwa, katenditi upyota kuusu yomberi. Lishaka limu, mfalumi Ela pakaweriti aku Tiriza ukaya kwa Arisa yakaweriti mgolokera gwa liboma, kalanditi na kalowera. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Zimri kingira mngati, kamlaga shakapanu kakolamlima pahala pakuyi. Ashi shiweriti shinja sha ishilini na saba sha ukolamlima wa Asa mfalumi gwa Yuda.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Katepu hera pakanjiti kukolamlima, Zimri kawalagiti wantu woseri wa kaya ya Baasha, kamlekera ndiri ata mpalu yumu wa kaya wakuyi pota waganja wakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Iweriti ntambu yakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu kuusu Baasha, kwa njira ya mbuyi gwa Mlungu Yehu. <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Vitwatira avi vitendikiti toziya ya vidoda vyakatenditi Baasha na mwana gwakuwi Ela. Wamkalaziyiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kwa kutenda vidoda na kuwatenda wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda kwa kuguwira vinyagu vya wamlungu yawu. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Matendu gamonga ga Ela, goseri galembitwi Mushitabu sha Mirandu ya shaka ya Wafalumi wa Israeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zimri mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Zimri kakolitimlima aku Israeli kulawa Tiriza kwa shaka sha mashaka saba. Ashi shiweriti shinja sha ishlini na saba sha ukolamlima wa Asa mfalumi gwa Yuda. Su, wantu wa Israeli waweriti watula ng'onjeru kuzyengeta mji gwa Gibetoni gwa Wafilisiti, <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />na mashonta ga wantu wa Israeli pawapikaniriti handa Zimri kaweriti katenda upyota, kamlaga mfalumi, woseri wamtenda Omri mkulu gwa shonta lawu, kuweri mfalumi gwa Israeli lishaka liraalilii. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Omri na mashonta gakuyi wawuka Gibetoni, wagenda na kuguzyengeta mji gwa Tiriza. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Shaka Zimri pakawoniti handa mji guzyengetwa, kingiriti kuliboma, mngati mwa liboma, kayilunguziya motu, na yomberi kahowera amu. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Shitwatira ashi shitendikiti toziya ya vidoda vyakatenditi, katenditi makontola palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, kamfata matendu ga Yerubowamu na kuwatenda wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda. <verse eid="1KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Matendu gamonga ga Zimri na upyota wakatenditi, goseri galembwa Mushitabu sha Mirandu ya shaka sha Wafalumi wa Israeli<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omri mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Wantu wa Israeli, vinu, wabagulangiti vipinga viwili. Shimu shimmaniti Tibini mwana gwa Ginati kaweri mfalumi, na shipinga sha pili shimmaniti Omri. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Muupeleru, wantu wa shipinga shashimmaniti Omri, wawaziditi makakala walii yawammaniti Tibini mwana gwakuyi Ginati, Tibini kahowa na Omri kawera mfalumi. <verse eid="1KI 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Omri kanjiti kukolamlima mshinja sha selasini na yimu sha ukolamlima wa Asa mfalumi gwa Yuda. Kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja lilongu na mbili, vinja sita kaweriti kankukolamlima kulawa mji gwa Tiriza, <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Kahemiriti lugongu lwa Samariya kwa vipandi elufi sita vya feza kulawa kwa muntu yumu yawamshema Shemeri, kanyawa liboma pampindi pakuyi, na mji. Mji gweni kagushema Samariya, kwa ligoya lya Shemeri yakalukoliti lugongu alu panu kwanja.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Omri katenditi madoda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, katenditi makontola nentu ya walii woseri yawamlongoliriti. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Toziya kafatiti matendu ga Yorebowamu mwana gwa Nebati, kamkalaziya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kwa kuwatenda wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda kwa kuguwira shinyagu sha wamlungu. <verse eid="1KI 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Matendu gamonga ga Omri na ugangamala wakuyi, goseri galembitwi Mushitabu sha Mirandu ya Shaka ya Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Upeleru, Omri kahowiti, kafindirwa aku Samaria, mwana gwakuyi Ahabu kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahabu mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Mushinja sha selasini na nani sha ukolamlima wa Asa mfalumi gwa Yuda, Ahabu mwana gwa Omri, kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli. Kakolitimlima aku Samariya kwa shaka sha vinja ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Ahabu katenditi makontola palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu kuliku wafalumi woseri yawamlongoliriti. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Viraa kafata magenderanu mdoda gwa Yerubowamu mwana gwa Nebati, Ahabu kamyugiti Yezeberi mhinga gwa Etibaali, mfalumi gwa Wasidoni, kamtendera na kumguwira Baali.<verse eid="1KI 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Kamnyawiliti Baali numba ya kuguwira aku Samaria, na mngati mwakuyi kanyawa shitalawanda sha kumguwira. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Ntambu iraayi, kanyawiti shinyagu sha Ashera mlungu gwa shidala. Ahabu katenditi makontola gavuwa, kamkalaziya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli nentu ya wafalumi woseri wa Israeli yawamlongoliriti. <verse eid="1KI 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Shaka sha ukolamlima wakuyi, Hieli kulawa Beteli, kagunyawiti syayi mji gwa Yeriku. Na teratera na shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shakalongiti kwa njira ya Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni, Hieli kasowilitwi na wiwuka wakuyi wa kwanja Abiramu, shaka sha kuyitula miyanjiru ya Yeriku, kasowiritwi viraa na mwana gwakuyi mdidika Segubu, shaka sha kuyitula migomi yakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Eliya kankutunga kuyuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Su Eliya kulawa Tishibi ya aku Gileyadi, kamgambira mfalumi Ahabu, “Nililapa Kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli yakawera mkomu mweni neni yanimguwira. Hapeni kuweri na mangami ama mvula mpaka pantakula shisoweru.”<verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Shakapanu, shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shimwiziriti Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />“Guwuki panu gugendi kwagulawa mshenji, gwakalififi kulushemba lwa Keriti lwaluwera kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba lya Yoridani. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Aku, hagupati mashi ga kulanda mulushemba alu kayi niwagambira kungulu wakujegeri shiboga.” <verse eid="1KI 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Su, Eliya kajimira lilagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu, kagenda kulikala kulushemba lya Keriti lwaluweriti kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba lwa Yoridani. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Kunguru wamjegera libumunda na shinofu, kila mandawira wamjegeriti mabumunda na vinofu pamihi, kalanda mashi kulawa mulushemba. <verse eid="1KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Kumbiti, pa shipindi tunga lushemba alu luyuma toziya itowa ndiri mvula muisi.<verse eid="1KI 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eliya na mawu mkenja gwa Serefati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Panu, shisoweru sha Mlungu, shimwizira Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />“Guwuki gugendi mjini Serefati, pakwegera na Sidoni, gulikali aku. Nimgambiziya mdala yumu mkenja kakupanani shiboga aku.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Su, Eliya kawuka, kagenda Serefati. Pakasokiti paligomi lya mji, kamwoniti mdala yumu mkenja kankusola mbawu. Eliya kamshema mdala ayu na kumgambira, “Gunjegeri shikombi sha mashi madidini nandi.” <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Mdala ulii pakaweriti kankuwuka kugenda kujega mashi, Eliya kamshemiti kayi na kumgambira, “Gunjegeri na shipandi sha libumunda viraa.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Mdala kamgambira, “Nikulapira kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku yakawera mkomu, nahera libumunda ata lididini. Shanwera nashi ndo liwoku limu lya ubumu mushiwiga na lipaki lididini musupa. Nsoka panu kusola mbawu, shakapanu ng'endi ukaya kutereka shiboga ashi, mwana gwangu na neni tuliyi shipeli, shakapanu tuhowi toziya ya njala.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Eliya kamgambira, “Nagutira. Gugendi gwakatendi ntambu yanongiti. Kumbiti gunyawiri neni uti na kunjegera liandazi lididini, shakapanu guliterekeri shiboga gwenga na mwanagwaku. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kalonga hangu, ubumu yawuwera mshiwiga mwaku hapeni upunguwi pota lipaki lyaliwera musupa hapeni lipunguwi, mpaka panu neni Mtuwa Mlungu pantowa mvula muisi.” <verse eid="1KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Su, mdala mkenja ayu kagenda katenda ntambu yakagambiritwi na Eliya, ata mawu ayu mwana gwakuyi na Eliya wapata shiboga kila lishaka. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Ubumu mshiwiga upunguka ndiri, pota lipaki musupa lipera ndiri teratera nakamu na shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiriti Eliya kalongi.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eliya kankumzyukusiya mwana gwa mawu mkenja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Pa aga, mwana gwa mdala ayu mweni kana numba kalwala, na ali yakuyi iyongereka kuwera layilayi, ata upeleru wakuyi kahowa. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Mdala ayu kamgambira Eliya, “Gwenga muntu gwa Mlungu, gwana shitwatira gaa na neni? Hashi gwiziti kwaneni kulaviya vidoda vyaneni na gunjegera kuhowa kwa mwana gwangu?”<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Eliya kamgambira, “Gunupi mwana gwaku.” Su, Eliya kamtola mwana pashifuwa pa mawu gwakuyi, kamtola kugenda pampindi pa shumba shakuyi, kamgonjeka pampindi pa shitanda shakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Shakapanu kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu, hashi, mdala ayu mkenja mweni nilikala kwakuyi na yomberi kankunolera, gumjegera madoda kumlaga mwana gwakuyi?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Shakapanu Eliya kaligonjeka pampindi pa mwana ayu mala ntatu na kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu. Mlungu gwangu, gumwuziliri mwana ayu ukomu wakuyi!” <verse eid="1KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu kapikanira kuluwa kwa Eliya, mwana kanja kupumula kayi. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Eliya kamwuziya mwana pasi kwa mawu gwakuyi, kamgambira, “Guloli! Mwana gwaku mkomu.” <verse eid="1KI 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Mdala mkenja ayu kamgambira Eliya, “Vinu nivimana nakaka handa gwenga ndo muntu gwa Mlungu, na visoweru vyakakupananiti Mtuwa Mlungu guvilongi ndo vya nakaka.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Ulagilagi wa Eliya kwa Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Pa shaka shivuwa, mushinja sha tatu sha kuyuma, shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shimwizira Eliya, “Gugendi gwakalilanguziyi kwa mfalumi Ahabu, shakapanu hantowi mvula muisi.” <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Su, Eliya kagenda kulilanguziya kwa Ahabu. Shaka ashi, njala iweriti ikalipa nentu aku Samariya. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Ahabu kamshema Obadiya mgolokera gwa liboma. Obadiya kaweriti muntu yakamguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />shaka Yezebeli pakawalagiti wambuyi wa Mtuwa Mlungu, Obadiya kawatoliti wambuyi wa Mlungu miya yimu, kawafifa amsiniamsini mumampanga mawili, kawera kankuwajegera shiboga na mashi. <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Shakapanu, Ahabu kamgambira Obadiya, “Gupiti muisi, kubwiru zoseri za mashi, na nshemba zoseri, pamonga hatupati ndundu na panu hatuwalopoziyi wafalasi wamu na punda farasi wa twenga, vigong'olu na wiza kufuwa hape tufiru kuwalaga.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Wabagulana isi su wapati kuyipitira yoseri, Ahabu kagenda uwega wumu na Obadiya uwega umonga.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Obadiya pakaweriti munjira, kaliwoniti na Eliya, na Obadiya pakammaniti Eliya, kang'ong'onala pasi na kulonga, “Hangu! Ndo gwenga mtuwa gwaneni Eliya?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Eliya kamgambira, “Yina! Ndo neni Eliya. Gugendi gwakamgambiri mtuwa gwaku handa napanu.”<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Obadiya kalonga, “Nkosa shishi ata gufira kundula muatali su naguwi na mfalumi Ahabu? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Nikulapira kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku yakaweri mkomu, handa mfalumi kawera kankukusakula pasipanu poseri. Na mfalumi yoseri pakalonga handa hakeniwoniki aku, Ahabu kamfiriti mfalumi ayu kalilapi na wantu wakuyi handa nakaka gwa panu. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Na vinu, gufira ng'endi kumgambira handa gwenga gwa panu! <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Nana lyoga katepu pambuka, Rohu gwa Mtuwa Mlungu hayikunyasuli na kukujega pahala panipamana ndiri! Ng'enda kumgambira Ahabu handa gwa panu, na yomberi pakakusakula na kakuwona ndiri, hakandagi neni, tembera neni ntumintumi gwaku nimguwira Mtuwa Mlungu kwanjira undemba wangu. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Hashi, gwahera shisoweru handa Yezebeli pakaweriti kankuwalaga wambuyi wa Mlungu, neni niwafifiti wambuyi wa Mlungu miya yimu, wantu amusiniamusini mlipanga, nwera nankuwapanana shiboga na mashi? <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Vinu gung'ambira ng'endi kumgambira mtuwa gwangu handa gwenga Eliya gwa palapanu! Ahabu hakantagi.” <verse eid="1KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Eliya kamgambira, “Nikulapira kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwa mashonta, yakalikala mweni nimtendera, Lelu ayi hanililaviyi palongolu pa mfalumi.” <verse eid="1KI 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Su, Obadiya kagenda kwa mfalumi Ahabu, kamupanana visoweru avi. Ahabu kagenda kuliwona na Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Ahabu pakamwoniti Eliya, kalongiti, “Kumbi nakaka ndo gwenga, mtabisiya gwa Waisraeli?”<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Eliya kamwankula, “Mtabisiya gwa Israeli neni ndiri, ndo gwenga na kaya ya tati gwaku. Mwenga mzilema lagiru za Mtuwa Mlungu na kuwaguwira wamlungu wa Baali. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Vinu guwajojoniri wantu woseri wa Israeli palongolu paneni kulugongu aku lwa Karimeli. Ntambu iraayi, guwajojoniri walii wambuyi miya msheshi na amusini wa Baali, na wambuyi wa miya msheshi wa Ashera mlungu gwa shidala, weni watenderuwa na Yezebeli.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Su, Ahabu kawashema wantu woseri wa Israeli, kawajojonira na wambuyi woseri kulii kuligongu lwa Karimeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Shakapanu, Eliya kawasegelera wantu awa, kawagambira, “Kwa shaka gaa hamuweli na maholu mawili? Payiwera Mtuwa Mlungu, ndo Mlungu mmufati, kumbiti payiwera Baali ndo Mlungu, su, mmufati Yomberi.” Kumbiti wantu wamwankula ndiri shisoweru shoseri. <verse eid="1KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Panu, Eliya kawagambira, “Neni hera ndo gweka yangu mbuyi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu yansigaliti, kumbiti wambuyi wa Baali kwana miya msheshi na amsini. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Aya! Mjegi wang'ombi shipalu wawili, wambuyi wa Baali walisyaguliri ng'ombi shipalu yumu, wamlikituli, wamhanjangi vipandi na kumtula pampindi pa mbawu, pota kukoziya motu. Naneni viraa hanimtoli ng'ombi shipalu yumonga, hanumlikituli na kumtula pampindi pa mbuwu pota kukoziya motu. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Shakapanu, womberi hawamluwi mlungu gwawu, Na neni hanimluwi Mtuwa Mlungu. Mlungu hakanankuli kwa kujega motu, ayu ndo Mlungu.” Na panu lipinga lyoseri halilongi, “Yina! Visowelu avi gwankula weli.” <verse eid="1KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Shakapanu, Eliya kawagambira wambuyi wa Baali, “Mwenga ndo mvuwa, su mwanji kulisyaguliliri ng'ombi shipalu, mmutandi na kumluwa mlungu gwenu, kumbiti namkoziya motu.” <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Wambuyi awa wamtola ng'ombi shipalu gwawu yawapananitwi, wamtanda, shakapanu wanja kumlilira Baali kulawa mandawira mpaka paliwala, pawakopokakopoka na kuwegukaweguka kushizyengeta shitalawanda shawanyawiti pawalonga, “Gwee Baali, gutupikaniri!” Kumbiti palawira ndiri liziwu lyoseri, pota kwahera yakawawankuliti. <verse eid="1KI 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Payisokiti saa sita paliwala, Eliya kanja kuwajongera pakalonga, “Mluwi kwa kubotanga! Yomberi ndo mlungu! Pamonga kawera mumaholu nentu, kagenda kumihamba, ama kamwanja! Ama kagonja, mfiruwa kumwimusiya!” <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Wambuyi awa wabotanga nentu, walihanjahanja kwa vimagi vididi na vimagi vikulu, kugenderana na shitiba shawu, ata walawa mwazi.<verse eid="1KI 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Waendiriyiti kubotanga na kulitenda handa wanalukwali mpaka paliwala shaka sha kulaviya tambiku, kumbiti kwahera yakawankuliti pota kuwashera.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Shakapanu, Eliya kawagambira wantu, “Msegeleri pakwegera naneni.” Womberi wamsegelera. Shakapanu Eliya kanyawa syayi shitalawanda sha Mtuwa Mlungu shashiweriti shibomuluwa. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Kagatoliti mabuwi lilongu na mawili, walanga ya makabira lilongu na mawili yagapananitwi matawu ga wana wa Yakobu geni Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti, “Litawu lyaku haliweri Israeli.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Kwa mabuwi aga, Eliya kamnyawiliti Mtuwa Mlungu, kabawa mfeleji kuzyengeta shitalawanda ashi, mfeleji yaguweza kutola lita lilongu na mhanu lya mashi. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Shakapanu kapanga mbawu weri, kamhanja vipandi ng'ombi shipalu ayu, kavitula pampindi pa mbawu. Shakapanu kawagambira wantu, “Mmemiziyi viwiga msheshi vikulu vya mashi mwakayitiri tambiku ayi ya kulunguziya na mbawu.” Watenda hangu. <verse eid="1KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Shakapanu kawagambira, “Mwuyiri kayi.” Nawomberi watenda hangu mala ya pili. Na yomberi kawagambira, “Mtendi hagu kayi mala ya tatu.” Womberi watenda hangu.<verse eid="1KI 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Mashi ganyililika pasi poseri wega zoseri za shitalawanda, mpaka gamemaziya mfeleji.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Pamihi shaka sha kulaviya tambiku, mbuyi gwa Mlungu Eliya kasegelera pashitalawanda, kaluwa, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Abrahamu na Isaka na Israeli, guwalanguziyi wantu leru ayi handa gwenga ndo Mlungu gwa Israeli na handa neni ndo ntumintumi gwa gwenga na ntenda mirandu ayi kwa amuli ya gwenga. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Gunankuli Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gunankuli su wantu awa wavimani kuwera gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu ndo Mlungu, na handa guyigalambula miyoyu yawu wakuwuyiri.” <verse eid="1KI 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Kamukamu Mtuwa Mlungu kasulusiya motu, kayilunguziya tambiku ayi ya kulunguziwa, mbuwu, mabuwi na lidikudiku, na kugayumuziya mashi goseri mumfereji.<verse eid="1KI 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Wantu pawawoniti hangu, waguwiti makukama pawalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu ndo Mlungu, Mtuwa Mlungu ndo Mlungu!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Eliya ndo kawagambira, “Muwabati wambuyi woseri wa mlungu gwa Baali. Namleka ata yumu gwawu katoloki!” Su, wantu wawabata woseri, na yomberi Eliya kawajega mlushemba Kishoni, kawalagira aku.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa kuyuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Pa haga, Eliya kamgambira mfalumi Ahabu, “Gugendi gwakaliyi na kulanda. Mpikanira mlindimiru gwa mvula.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Su, Ahabu kagenda zyakuwi kuliya na kulanda, na yomberi Eliya kakwena pampindi paupeleru wa lugongu Karimeli, na aku kang'ong'ola mpaka pasi na kushitula sheni shakuyi pakati pa manung'unu gakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Shakapanu kamgambira ntumintumi gwakuyi, “Vinu, gugendi gwakalori uwega wa Bahari.” Ntumintumi kagenda, kalola, shakapanu kawuya kalonga, “Kwahera shintu.” Eliya kamgambira, “Gugendi mala saba kukola.” <verse eid="1KI 18:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Mala ya saba, ntumintumi ayu kawuya, kalonga, “mona liwundi lididika handa ukulu wa shiganja sha muntu shilawa mubahari.” Eliya kamgambira, “Gugendi gwakamgambiri mfalumi Ahabu katandi mbutuka yakuwi ya kukwega kwa farasi, kasuluki, nakiza kutenduwa na mvula.”<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Shaka shivuwa ndiri mpindi ziyalika mawundi gazotopa, lyega livuma, itowa mvula nkulu. Ahabu na yomberi kakwena mbutuka yakuwi ya kukwega na farasi, kawuya Yerizeeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Makakala ga Mtuwa Mlungu gamwizira Eliya, na yomberi kalitawa ng'ering'eri lihabiti lyakuyi, katuga na kumlongolera Ahabu kwingira kumjini Yezireeli.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Eliya kulugongu lya Sinayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Mfalumi Ahabu kamtambiliti mdala gwakuyi Yezebeli, mirandu yoseri yakatenditi Eliya na ntambu yakawalagiti wambuyi wa mlungu Baali kwa ligumba. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Yezebeli katuma ulagilagi kwa Eliya kamgambiri. “Wamlungu wandagiri kutali, nikulapira, payiwera saa ayi shirawu hapeni nikutendi handa yumu gwa awa mbuyi wa mlungu.” <verse eid="1KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Eliya katiriti nentu ndo mana katugira mjini Beeri Sheba kumkoa gwa Yuda, kwakamlekiti ntumintuni gwakuyi, <verse eid="1KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />yomberi kagenda mwanja gwa lishaka lyoseri kwingira kushiwala. Su kasoka, kalivaga pasi pa mtera gumu, yagushemwa mletemu. Panu, kaluwa kahowi, pakalonga, “Intosiya! Weza ndiri kayi. Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, vinu gulaviyi ukomu waneni. Neni nfaa ndiri kuliku wambuyi wangu.”<verse eid="1KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Su, Eliya kagonja pasi pa mtera agu, kakolwa na mbota. Kamukamu, ntumintumi gwa kupindi, kamshinkula na kamgambira, “Gwimuki guliyi.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Eliya pakaloliti, kaliwona libumunda lyalibanikitwi pampindi pa makala, na supa ya mashi pakwegera na mtuwi gwakuyi. Su, kaliya na kulanda na kagonja kayi. <verse eid="1KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamwizira kayi mala ya pili, kamshinkula na kumgambira, “Gwimuki guliyi, hera hangu mwanja haguweri gukamala nentu kwa gwenga.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Eliya kimuka, kaliya na kulanda. Shakapanu kagendagenda kwa likakala lya shiboga ashi mwanja gwa mashaka alubayini, paliwala na pashiru, mpaka Horebu lugongu lwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Aku, kasoka kulipanga, kagonja amu. Vumu shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shimwizira. “Eliya! Gwankutenda shishi panu?” <verse eid="1KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Na Yomberi kalonga, “Nweriti nankukutendera kwa ugangamala gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, ila wantu wa Israeli wamega lipatanu lyaku, wavibomola vitalawanda vyaku na kuwalaga wambuyi waku kwa ligumba, ndo neni hera yansigaliti, na neni viraa wanwinda su wandagi!”<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gugendi gwakagoloki kulugongu, palongolu pangu neni Mtuwa Mlungu.” Su, Mtuwa Mlungu kapita na kulivumisiya liyega likalipa lyeni libolomola migongu na kugapandanga matalawu. Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti ndiri muliyega ali. Liyega lipita, kuweriti na lilendemeru lya litapaka. Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti ndiri mulilendemeru lya litapaka. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Lilendemeru lipita, kuweriti na motu. Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti ndiri mumotu agu. Pa kupita motu, lilawira liziwu lididini, lya mpolimpoli. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Su, Eliya pakapikaniriti liziwu ali, kaligibikiriti sheni kwa lihabiti lyakuyi, kawuka na kugoloka paligomi lya lipanga. Panu, kapikanira liziwu, “Eliya! Gwankutenda shishi panu?” <verse eid="1KI 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Yomberi kalonga, “Mona kutama na weya, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa mashonta, kumbiti wantu wa Israeli wamega lipatanu lyaku, wavibomola vitawalanda vyaku na kuwalaga wambuyi waku kwa ligumba, ndo neni hera yansigaliti, naneni viraa wankunwinda wandagi!”<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Guwuyi kwa kupitira njira ya kushiwala mpaka Damasiko. Pagusoka, gumswagi lipaki Hazaeli kaweri mfalumi gwa Aramu. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Na Yehu, mwana gwa Nimshi, gummiminili lipaki kaweri mfalumi gwa Israeli. Elisha, mwana gwa Shafati, gwa Abeli Mehola, hagummimini lipaki kaweri mbuyi gwa Mlungu pahala pagwenga. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Su, yoseri yakaponeka ligumba gwa Hazaeli, Yehu hakamlagi, na yoseri yakaponeka ligumba gwa Yehu, Elisha hakamlagi. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Kumbiti, wankali wakomu wantu elufu saba muisi ya Israeli, weni hawenimguwiri Baali, pota kushinonera shinyagu shakuyi.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha kankushemwa kaweri mbuyi gwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Eliya kawuka, kamwona Elisha, mwana gwa Shafati, kankulima. Panu, paweriti na ng'ombi ishilini na msheshi yawalima waliwali na ng'ombi wawili wa Elisha waweriti wa kumbeli nentu. Su, Eliya kalivula lihabiti lyakuyi na kumgibikira. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Panu, Elisha kawaleka ng'ombi wakuyi, kamfata Eliya mbiru na kumgambira, “Gunjimili uti ng'endi kumpanana tati gwangu na mawu gwangu nonera ya kwaheree, shakapanu nikufati.” Eliya kamwankula, “Gugendi! Nikubera ndiri” <verse eid="1KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Su, Elisha kamleka Eliya, kawawuziya ng'ombi wawili awa, kawalikitula na kuwatereka pakatendera mitera ya shimbingapinga handa mbawu, kawapanana wantu, waliya. Shakapanu kawuka, kamfata Eliya na kuwera ntumintumi gwakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Nkondu pakati pa Israeli na Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Beni Hadadi mfalumi gwa Aramu, kalijojoniriti shonta lyakuyi lyoseri, kafatitwi na wafalumi wamonga selasini na mbili pamuhera na farasi na mbutuka yawu ya kukwega na farasi Kagugenderiti mji gwa Samaliya kaguzyengeta na kugukomanga. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Shakapanu, katumiti walagilagi wakuyi kumjini kwa mfalumi Ahabu gwa Israeli, wamgambira, “Mfalumi Bena Hadadi kalonga hangu. <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />Madini ga feza gaku na zahabu zaku zoseri ndo lunda yaneni, wadala waku waherepa na wana waku, viraa ndo waneni.” <verse eid="1KI 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Na mfalumi gwa Israeli kankula, “Mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, ntambu yagulongiti ndo teratera. Neni ndo gwa gwenga, na vyoseri vyanweri navi ndo vya gwenga.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Shakapanu, walagilagi awa wamwuyira kayi Ahabu, wamgambira, “Mfalumi Bena Hadadi kalonga hangu, nikujegiriti ulagilagi gunupi zahabu na madini ga feza na wadala waku pamuhera na wana waku. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Vinu, shirawu shaka handa ashi, haniwatumi wantumintumi wangu wizi kulisakula liboma na numba za wantumintumi waku, watoli kila shintu shagushifira.”<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Ahabu mfalumi gwa Israeli, kawashema wakulu woseri wa isi, kawagambira, “Vinu, mmuloli ayu ntambu yakafira kututabisiya! Katuma ulagilagi handa kafira wadala waneni na wana waneni na zahabu na madini ga feza zyaneni. Naneni numbelera ndiri!” <verse eid="1KI 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Wazewi na wantu woseri wamgambira, “Nagumshera pota nagujimira.” <verse eid="1KI 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Su, Ahabu kawagambira walagilagi wa Beni Hadadi, “Mugambiri mtuwa gwaneni mfalumi hangu. Nakala kutenda mafiriziwu gaku ga kwanja, kumbiti aga ga pili njimira ndiri ata shididini.” Panu, walagilagi awa wagenda zawu na kumgambira kayi mfalumi Beni Hadadi. <verse eid="1KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Beni Hadadi kamjegera Ahabu ulagilagi awu, “Wamlungu na wandagiri kutali, nikulapira, payiwera aku Samariya hakusigali madikudiku ga kutosheya shiwoku shimu kwa kila yumu gwa wantu waneni wavuwa!” <verse eid="1KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Mfalumi Ahabu gwa Israeli kankula, “Mugambiri mfalumi Beni Hadadi handa shikambaku kalizyuma pa nkondu, pamberi ndiri!”<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />“Beni Hadadi kankiti ulagilagi awu wa Ahabu shaka yomberi na wafalumi pawamjimiriti pawaweriti mumalingu mwawu wankulanda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:12">Su, kagagambira mashonta gakuyi gaweri kala kwa kulikomanga na womberi wawera kala.”<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Shaka shiraashi, mbuyi yumu kamgendera Ahabu, mfalumi gwa Israeli, kamgambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Guwona kuvuwa kwa mashonta awa? Leru ayi hanuwatuli mmawoku mwaku, na gwenga haguvimani handa neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Na Ahabu kakosiya, “Ga hakatulonguziyi kulikomanga?” Mbuyi gwa Mlungu kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, wantemba yawatendera mashonta pasi pa wakulu wa wilaya. ” Na mfalumi kakosiya, “Ndo gaa yakaweri gwa kwanja kulikomanga?” Mbuyi gwa Mlungu kankula, “Gwenga!”<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Su, mfalumi Ahabu kawashema wantemba yawatendiriti mumashonta pasi pa wakulu wa wilaya, walanga yawu yoseri wantu miya mbili na selasini na wawili. Shakapanu kalishema lishonta lya Israeli, wamashonta elufi saba.<verse eid="1KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Su, payisokiti saa sita Beni Hadadi na wafalumi wayaguyi walii selasini na wawili wamjimiriti pawaweriti mumalingu mwawu pawalanda na kulowera, makomangu ganja. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />“Mashonta wantemba yawaweriti wankutenda lihengu pasi pa wakulu wa wilaya, walongolera. Shaka ashi, Beni Hadadi kaweriti kawajegiti kala wantu wa kulolalola, na womberi wampanana shisoweri handa kuweriti na shipinga sha wantu wawiziti kulawa Samariya.” <verse eid="1KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Beni Hadadi kamgambira, “Muwabati wankali wakomu. Ata handa wakwiza kwa nkondu ama kwa ponga.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Mashonta wantemba walii walongoziyiti makomangu, pamberi pawu, wankuwafata wamashonta wa Israeli, <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Kila yumu gwawu kamlaga ngondu yumu. Wantu wa Aramu watugiti mbiru, na womberi wamashonta wa Israeli wafatiti, kumbiti Bena Hadadi, mfalumi gwa Aramu, pakawera kakwena farasi, katoloka na wamu wa wamashonta wakwena farasi. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Su, mfalumi gwa Israeli kakanka nkondu, katola farasi na mbutuka za kukwega zivuwa, na kuwalaga wantu wa Aramu wavuwa.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Shakapanu, mbuyi ulii gwa Mlungu kamgendera mfalumi gwa Israeli, kamgambira, “Gulitandi syayi guliholi hweri sha kutenda. Shinja shashiza, mfalumi gwa Aramu hakizi kulikomanga kayi na gwenga.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waaramu wankuwakomanga kayi wantu wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Wantumini wa mfalumi Beni Hadadi wamgambiriti hangu, “Wamlungu wa Waisraeli ndo wamlungu wa kumigongu, ndo mana tusinditi. Kumbiti hatuwakanki handa patulikomanga na womberi pahala palulalanda. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Vinu, guwawusiyi wafalumi walii selasini na mbili na pahala pawu guwatuli wakulu wa mashonta. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Gulitandi shonta handa liraalirii lyagulyagamiziyiti, farasi na mbutuka za kukwegwa handa zilii zyaguhowiziyiti. Shakapanu hatulikomangi na womberi pahala lalanda na su hatuwazidi makakala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:25">Mfalumi Beni Hadadi kapikanira shawamgambaziyiti, katenda hangu. <verse eid="1KI 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Katepu pa shaka sha mbepu, mfalumi Beni Hadadi kawajojoniriti wantu wakuyi, kagenda kumjini Afeka kulikomanga na wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Na wantu wa Israeli wajojoniritwi vipinga vididini viwili na kupananwa vintu vya kulikomangira, wagenda kuliwona na Waaramu. Wantu wa Israeli watuliti ng'onjeru mbili, wawonikana handa vipinga vididinivididini vya mbuzi, kumbiti Waaramu waeniyiti poseri paisi.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Muntu gwa Mlumgu kamgendiriti Mfalumi gwa Israeli, kamgambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Toziya Waaramu walonga handa neni Mtuwa Mlungu ndo Mlungu gwa kulugongu pota Mlungu ndiri gwa kululalanda, nikupanani ukanka kwa lishonta ali likulu, na gwenga haguvimani handa neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Wantu wa Israeli na Waaramu watuliti lugonjeru kwa shaka sha mashaka saba, pawalilolana. Lishaka lya saba, makomangu ganja. Lishaka liraalilii, wantu wa Israeli wawalaga mashonta wamagulu laki yimu. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Yawasigaliti, watugiriti mjini Afeki, aku shibambaza sha mji shiwaguwiriti na kuwalaga wantu elufu ishilini na saba yawasigaliti. Beni Hadadi viraa katugiti na kulififa mushumba tunga sha mngati, mjini. <verse eid="1KI 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Wantumini wakuyi wamgendera wamgambira, “Tupikanira handa wafalumi wa Israeli ndo wantu wana lusungu. Su, gujimili tulitawi mafafa mshinu na ngoyi msingu, tumgenderi mfalumi gwa Israeli. Pamonga hakagaponiziyi makaliru gaku.” <verse eid="1KI 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Su, walitawa mafafa mushunu na ngoyi musingu mwawu, wamgendera mfalumi gwa Israeli, wamgambira, “Ntumintumi gwaku, Beni Hadadi, kakuluwa pakalonga, shondi gundeki nilikali. Ahabu kalonga, kumbi kankali kankulikala? Yomberi ndo mlongu gwangu.” <verse eid="1KI 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Wantumintumi wa Beni Hadadi waweriti wankutumbira lilanguliru lyoseri lilii lya baati iherepe, su, Ahabu pakalongiti hangu, womberi wanka pawalonga, “Yina, Beni Hadadi ndo mlongu gwaku!” Ahabu kawagambira, “Mgendi mwakamjegi kwaneni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Su, Beni Hadadi pakamwiziriti, Ahabu kamfira kalikali na yomberi mumbutuka yakuyi ya kukwegwa farasi. <verse eid="1KI 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Shakapanu, Beni Hadadi kamgambira, “Miji yoseri yeni tati gwangu kampokiti tati gwaku, hanikuwuziliri. Guweza kutenda masoku aku Damasiku ntambu yakatenditi tati gwangu aku Samaria.” Ahabu kankula, “Hanikulekeleri kwa matakulu aga.” Panu, katenda mapatanu na yomberi na kumpanana lekeru.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuyi gwa Mlungu kamupangira Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Kwa amuli ya Mtuwa Mlungu, yumu gwawu gwa wambuyi gwa Mlungu, kamgambira myaguyi, “Shondishondi gunkomi.” Kumbiti myanguyi kalema kumkoma. <verse eid="1KI 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Na yomberi kamgambira, “Toziya gulema amuli ya Mtuwa Mlungu, su, kamukamu hera pagulileka naneni, simba hakakulagi.” Nakaka, katepu hera pawalekaniti na yomberi, kaliwona na simba, simba kamlagi muntu ayu.<verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Shakapanu, mbuyi ayu kamwona muntu yumonga, kamgambira, “Shondi gunkomi.” Muntu ayu kamkoma na kamtenda. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Su, mbuyi gwa Mlungu kawuka, kagenda kalikala pambwega pa njira, kumhepera mfalumi gwa Israeli, agawu pakalitawa shitambala kusheni, nakamanika. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Mfalumi pakaweriti kankupita, mbuyi gwa Mlungu kamlilira pakalonga, “Mtuwa, neni ntumintumii gwaku nweriti nankulikoma kunkondu, kiza shonta yumu, kanjegera mlopola yumu na kung'ambira, gumloleri muntu ayu, pakatoloka hagulipi kwa ukomu waku gamweni, ama kwa vipandi elufi tatu vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Kumbiti panweriti nankutenda mahengu gamonga, muntu ayu katoloka.” Mfalumi gwa Israeli kamgambira, “Ndo ntambu yayifira kuwera toza yaku gulitoza gamweni.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Panu, mbuyi gwa Mlungu kawusiya kalongola shitambala pasheni shakuyi, na yomberi mfalumi kammana kuwera yumu gwa wambuyi. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Su, mbuyi gwa Mlungu kamgambira mfalumi, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Toziya gumlekeziya muntu mweni nongiti kalangwi kakupota, su makaliru gakuyi hagulipi kwa makaliru gaku na wantu wakuyi kwa wantu waku.”<verse eid="1KI 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Su, mfalumi gwa Israeli kagenda zyakuwi ukaya Samaliya, kana ngalaliru na hinginika ivuwa.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Lirambu lya Naboti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Naboti, mwenikaya gwa Yezeeli, kaweriti na lirambu lya mizyabibu aku Yezireeli, pakwegera na liboma lya Ahabu mfalumi gwa Samaliya. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Lishaka limu Ahabu kamgambiriti Naboti, “Gumpanani lirambu lyaku lya mizyabibu nilitendi lirambu lya likolu, toziya lyapakwegera na numba yaneni. Hanikupanani lirambu limonga liherepa nentu, ama pagufira hanikulipi mpiya kulinganira na ulunda wakuyi.” <verse eid="1KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Kumbiti, Naboti kamwakula, “Mlandu gwa kukupanana gwenga uhala yaniwupatiti kwa wazewi waneni, Mlungu kaliwusiliri patali.” <verse eid="1KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Panu, Ahabu kagenda zakuyi ukaya kana nkalaliru na maholu gavuwa, toziya Naboti mwenikaya gwa Yezireeli, kamgambiriti handa hapeni kampanani shirii shakahaliti kulawa kwa wazewi wakuyi. Su, kaligonjeka mshitanda shakuyi, kashififa sheni shakuyi na kulema kuliya. <verse eid="1KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Yezebeli mdala gwakuyi kamgendera na kumkosiya, “Mbona gwana hinginika mmoyu ata guliya ndiri?”<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Yomberi kamwankula, “Toziya nyoweriti na Naboti mwenikaya gwa Yezireeli, kambuziri lirambu lyakuyi lya mizyabibu, ama pakafira numpanani lirambu limonga handa ali. Kumbiti yomberi kang'ambira, nikupanani ndiri lirambu lyangu lya mizyabibu.”<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Panu, Yezebeli, mdala gwakuyi, kamgambira, “Yakakolamlima gwa Israeli ndo gaa? Gwenga ndiri? Gwimuki, gulii na gukalamuki, neni hanikupanani lirambu lya mizyabibu lya Naboti kulawa Yezireeli.”<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Shakapanu, Yezebeli kalembiti hamba zyamu kwa litawu lya Ahabu na kukomelera shimaniziyu sha mfalumi. Shakapanu kajega luhamba alu kwa wazewi na wantu wamanika, yawalikaliti na Naboti aku kumjini. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Hamba zyeni zilembwa hangu, “Mbweri shaka cha kwoya kuliya, mliwoni na kumpanana Naboti pahali pa ligoya pakati pa wantu. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Shakapanu, muwawasakuli wantu yawatenda madoda wawili wamgenderi na kumsitaki pawalonga, gwenga gumpangira Mlungu na mfalumi. Shakapanu mmulaviyi kunja, mmulagi kwa kumgumanga mabuwi.”<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Su, wenikaya wayaguyi Naboti, wazewi na wantu wamanika wa mji Yezireeli, watenda handa Yezebeli ntambu yakawalagaliriti. Kulawirana na luhamba lwakawajegeriti. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Wabwera shaka sha kwoya kuliya, waliwona na kumtula Naboti pahala pa ligoya pakati pa wantu. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Watenda madoda wawili walii walivaga kumlola Naboti, shakapanu wamsitaki paweru pawalonga, “Naboti kampangira Mlungu na mfalumi.” Naboti wamlaviyiti kunja kumji, kalaguwa kwa kugumangwa mabuwi. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Shakapanu, Yezebeli kajegelwa shisoweru handa “Naboti kalaguwa kala kwa kugumangwa mabuwi.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Katepu hera Yezebeli pakapatiti shisoweru handa Naboti kalaguwa kala kwa kugumangwa mabuwi, kamgambira Ahabu, “Gugoloki! Gugendi gwakalitoli lirambu lilii lya mizyabibu lya Naboti kulawa Yezereeli, lyeni kalemiti kukuwuzira. Naboti kankali mkomu kayi ndiri, kahowa kala.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Katepu Ahabu pakapikaniriti Naboti kahowa kala, kagoloka kagenda kutola lirambu lya mizyabibu lya Naboti.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuyi gwa Mlungu Eliya kankumkalapira Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Su, shisoweru sha Mlungu shimwizira mbuyi gwa Mlungu Eliya kulawa Tishibe, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />“Gugoloki gugendi kuliwona na Ahabu mfalumi gwa Israeli, mweni ka Samaliya. Hagumwoni mulilambu lya mizyabibu lya Naboti, kalitola. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Gumgambiri, Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, gumlaga su gutola lilambu lyakuyi? Gumgambiri Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, pahala palii ng'ang'a pakalambititi mwazi gwa Naboti, ndo hawagulambiti mwazi gwaku.”<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Su, Ahabu pakamwoniti Eliya, kalonga, “Gwenga mnkondu gwangu, gumbata?” Eliya kamwankula, “Yina! Nukupata, Toziya gwenga gupanga nakamu kutenda madoda palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, nakaka, hanikujegeri maagamiziya. Hanikulagi gwenga na kuwalaga kila mpalu gwa lukolu lwaku Muisraeli, kaweri mmanda ama mlekeru. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Kaya yaku haniyitendi handa kaya ya Yerobowamu, mwana gwa Nebati na handa kaya ya Baasha mwana gwa Ahiya, toziya gwimiziya maya gangu na kuwatenda wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda. <verse eid="1KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />Kayi, Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hanga kwa Yezebeli, wang'ang'a hawayiliyi nshimba ya Yezebeli mshibambaza sha numba ya shifalumi ya liboma lya Yezireli. <verse eid="1KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />Yina, yoseri gwa kaya yakuyi yakahowera kumjini, wang'ang'a hawamliyi, na yoseri yakahowera kulilambu, kapungu wa kulyera hawamliyi.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />Kwahera muntu yakafira kutenda madoda palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu handa Ahabu, mweni kapayiritwi na Yezebeli mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Katenditi nkalaliru kwa kuguwira shinyagu sha wamlungu ntambu yawatenditi Waamori weni mashaka gapititi Mtuwa Mlungu kawawingiti palongolu pa wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Kumbiti, Ahabu pakapikaniriti visoweru avi, kazipapula nguwu zakuyi kavala mafafa gweka yakuyi kwoya kuliya na kugonja pampindi pa mafafa katyanga agawu na agawu kwa hinginika.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Su, ulagilagi awu wa Mtuwa Mlungu umwizira mbuyi Eliya kulawa Tishibe, <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />“Gumwona Ahabu ntambu yakalinanagaziya palongolu paneni? Toziya gulinanagaziya, njegi ndiri maagamiziya pakawera mkomu, kumbiti shaka sha ukolamlima wa mwana gwakuyi haniagamiziyi kaya yakuyi Ahabu.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Mbuyi gwa Mlungu Mikiya kankumkalapira Ahabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 18:2-27">2 Mirandu 18:2-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Kwa vinja vitatu, kuweriti na ponga pakati pa Israeli na Aramu, <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />kumbiti mushinja sha tatu,Yehoshafati, Mfalumi gwa Yuda, kasokiti kumtyangira Ahabu, Mfalumi gwa Israeli.<verse eid="1KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Ahabu kawagambira wantumintumi wakuyi, “Hashi, mvimana ndiri handa Ramoti Gileyadi ndo ya twenga? Su tutenda shintu ndiri kuguwuziya kulawa kwa Mfalumi gwa Aramu?” <verse eid="1KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Su kamkosiya Yeshofati, “Hashi, hagugendi naneni kulikomanga aku Ramati Gileadi?” Na Yoshofati kamwankula Mfalumi gwa Israeli, “Yina, neni na gwenga ndo shintu shimu, na viraa wantu waneni ndo wantu wa gwenga, farasi waneni ndo farasi waku.” <verse eid="1KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Shakapanu Yehoshafati kendereya kumgambira mfalumi gwa Israeli, “Kumbiti, kwanja gumkosiyi Mtuwa Mlungu shakutenda.”<verse eid="1KI 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Su, Ahabu kajojonira wambuyi miya msheshi, kawakosiya, “Hashi, ng'endi ama ng'endi ndiri kugukomanga mji gwa Ramoti Gileadi?” Na womberi wamwankula, “Gugendi! Mtuwa Mlungu hakakupanani ukanka.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Kumbiti, Yoshofati kalonga, “Hashi, panu kwahera mbuyi gwa Mlungu yumonga mweni tuweza kumkosiya shakutenda?” <verse eid="1KI 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Mfalumi gwa Israeli kamwankula Yoshofati, “Kapanu, kankali yumu, Mikaya mwana gwa Imla. Yomberi tuweza kumkosiya Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga haa. Kumbiti numkalalira nentu toziya yomberi katunga ndiri shitwatira shiheri kuusu neni, ila madoda hera.” Yehoshofati kamgambira, “Iyerepe ndiri mfalumi kulonga hangu.” <verse eid="1KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Su Ahabu, mfalumi gwa Israeli, kamshema ntumintumi yumu, kamgambira, “Kalongola! Gugendi gwakamjegi Mikaya mwana gwa Imla.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Shaka ashi, mfalumi gwa Israeli pamuhera na Yehoshifati mfalumi gwa Yuda, waweriti walivaga muviti vyawu vya shifalumi pawalivaga paluwaga lwa kukomera viboga lijengu lyana ligomi lya kwingilira kumjini Samaliya na womberi waweriti wavala nguwu zawu za Shifalumi, shaka ashi wambuyi wa Mlungu woseri wawera wankutunga palongolu pawu. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Shakapanu yumu gwa wambuyi yakashemwa Sedekiya mwana gwa Kenaana, kalinyawira magoli ga shuma pakalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, kwa magoli aga, haguwakomi Waaramu na kuwaagamiziya.” <verse eid="1KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Ata walii wambuyi wamonga woseri watungiti ntambu iraayi, walonga, “Gugendi gukagukomangi Ramoti Gileyadi, ugukanki! Mtuwa Mlungu hakakupanani ukanka.” <verse eid="1KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Shaka shiraaashi ntumintumi yakatumitwi kwa Mikaya, kamgambiriti, “Wambuyi wamonga woseri kwa pamuhera, wamtungira mfalumi ukanka, shondi, na gwenga gutendi handa womberi, gumtungili maheri.” <verse eid="1KI 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Kumbiti Mikaya kamwankula, “Nililapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, neni hantakuli hera galii gakafira kung'ambira Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="1KI 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Su Mikaya pakasokiti palongolu pa Mfalumi, mfalumi kamkosiya, “Hashi, tugendi kulikomanga nkondu aku Ramoti Gileyadi ama tugendi ndiri?” Na yomberi kamwankuliti, “Gugendi na guwakomi, na yomberi Mtuwa Mlungu hakagutuli mumawoku mwaku.” <verse eid="1KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Kumbiti mfalumi kamgambira, “Nikulapiliri mala ninga handa pagulonga naneni kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, ndo mpaka gung'ambili unakaka hera?” <verse eid="1KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Mikaya kalonga, “Moniti wantu woseri wa Israeli wapalanganika kuvigongu handa kondolu wahera mlolera. Na Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, wantu awa wahera mlonguziya, su wawuyi kila muntu ukaya kwakuyi kwa ponga.”<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Panu mfalumi gwa Israeli kamgambira Yoshofati, “Nukugambiriti ndiri handa hapeni katungi liheri kwa neni ila madoda hera?” <verse eid="1KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Shakapanu Mikaya kalonga, “Aya gupikanili shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu. Nimwoniti Mtuwa Mlungu kalivaga mushiti shakuwi sha Shifalumi, na shonta lyoseri lya kumpindi ligoloka pambwega pakuyi, uwega wakuyi wa kumliyu na wa kumshigi, <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu kakosiya, ndo gaa yakafira kumtendi Ahabu kagendi kulikomanga su kalaguwi aku Ramoti Gileyadi? Kila yumu kankula ntambu yakaliholiti, <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Shakapanu rohu yumu kalilaviya palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, pakalonga, neni hanimtendi katendi shintu ashi. <verse eid="1KI 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamkosiya, kwa njira gaa? Na yomberi kankula, hang'endi na kulitenda rohu gwa mpayu na kuwatenda wambuyi wa mpayu. Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, gwenga hagumgambiziyi na haguwezi, su, gugendi gukatendi hangu.”<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />“Su, ntambu yayiwera. Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenda wambuyi wakuyi woseri awa walongi mpayu. Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga madoda kwa gwenga!”<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Shakapanu, Sedekiya, mwana gwa Kenaana, kamsegelera Mikaya, kamwakula likofi mlisaya na kumkosiya, “Kwanjira ndii Rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu indeka neni, yiza kuyowera na gwenga?” <verse eid="1KI 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikaya kankula, “Lishaka pakingira mushumba sha mngati kulififa, ndo haguvimani.” <verse eid="1KI 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Na yomberi Mfalumi gwa Israeli kalagalira, “Mmubati Mikaya, mmuwuziyi kwa Amoni, mkulu gwa mji na kwa Yowashi mwana gwa mfalumi. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Guwagambiri wamtatili mshifungu na kumliyiziya libumunda lididini na mashi, mpaka pambuya mkomu.” <verse eid="1KI 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Ndo Mikaya pakalongiti, “Paguwuya mkomu su, guvimani handa Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga ndiri na neni.” Shakapanu kendereya kulonga, “Mgaholi aga wantu woseri!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Ahabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 18:28-34">2 Mirandu 18:28-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Su, mfalumi gwa Israeli kagenda pamuhera na mfalumi Yehoshafati gwa Yuda, wajega mashonta gawu aku Ramoti Gileyadi. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Mfalumi wa Israeli kamgambira Yehoshafati, “Neni hanvali nguwu zyaziwera ndiri za shifalumi na kwingira mnkondu kumbiti gwenga guvali nguwu zaku za shifalumi.” Hangu mfalumi gwa Israeli kagenda kunkondu pota kuvala nguwu za shifalumi.<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Mfalumi gwa Aramu kaweriti kawagambira wakulu wa mashonta wakuyi selasini na wawili yawagolokeriti mbutuka zakuyi za kukwegwa na farasi, pakalonga. “Namlikomanga na muntu yoseri yulii, mkulu ama mdidini, ila hera na mfalumi gwa Israeli.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Shakapanu, wakulu wa mashonta awa pawamwoniti Yehoshafati, walongiti, “Nakaka, ayu ndo mfalumi gwa Israeli.” Hangu, wamgendiriti, wamkomi, kumbiti Yehoshafati kabotanga. <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />Wakulu wa mashonta pawavimaniti handa kaweriti ndiri mfalumi gwa Israeli walekiti kumkoma, wawuya. <verse eid="1KI 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Kumbiti, lishonta yumu gwa Aramu, kanika upindi wakuyi kaguma hera, msali gumsoma mfalumi gwa Israeli pahala pa mawungiru ga nguwu zakuyi za shuma. Ahabu kamgambira muendesha mbutuka gwakuyi ya kukwegwa na farasi, “Gugalambuli mbutuka gumbusiyi kunkondu. Ndenduwa!” <verse eid="1KI 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Na makomangu lishaka ali gaweriti makulu, aku mfalumi kaseniziwa mumbutuka, kankuwalola wantu wa Aramu. Mwazi guweriti gwankumlawa mshilonda na kunyililika mumbutuka. Payisokiti pamihi kahowa. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Shaka sha mshenji kuzyeta kupinilika kulira, “mashonta waligambirana kila muntu kawuyi ukaya kwakuyi!”<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Mfalumi Ahabu pakahowiti kajegitwi Samaliya, kafindirwa aku. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Mbutuka yakuyi ya kukwegwa na farasi wayigululiti mulitanda lya Samaliya, wang'ang'a wagulambita mwazi gwakuyi na wahumba wayoga amu, teratera na shisoweru shakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Matendu gamonga ga mfalumi Ahabu, ntambu yakanyawiti na kuherepiziya numba yakuyi kwa magoli ga ndembu na miji yoseri yana liboma yakanyawiti ilembitwi mushitabu sha Mirandu ya Shaka sha Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Ahabu pakahowiti, mwana gwakuyi Ahaziya kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati mfalumi gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 20:31-21:1">2 Mirandu 20:31-21:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Mushinja sha msheshi sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Ahabu gwa Israeli, Yehoshafati mwana gwa Asa, kanjiti kukolamlima Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yehoshafati kaweriti na vinja selasini na mhanu pakanjiti kukolamlima. Kakolitimlima kulawa Yerusalemu kwa shaka sha vinja ishilini na mhanu. Mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Azuba mhinga gwa Shilihi. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Handa tati gwakuyi Asa pamberi pakuyi, katenditi maheri palongolu pa masu ga Mtuwa Mlungu kumbiti pahala pa kuguwira kapahalibisiya ndiri na wantu wendereyiti kulaviya tambiku na kulunguziya ubani aku. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Yehoshafati katenda ponga pamuhera na mfalumi gwa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Mirandu yoseri yakatenditi Yehoshafati, goseri ga ugangamala na ga shinkondu, galembitwi Mushitabu sha maholu ga wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Wapalu na wadala yawatenda uhumba muvilingu vya wantu yawammana Mlungu yawaweriti kwanjira shaka sha tati gwakuyi Asa, Yehoshafati kawawusiyiti muisi.<verse eid="1KI 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Muisi ya Edomu kuweriti ndiri na mfalumi, isi ayi ikolitwimlima na mtanga yakasyagulitwi na mfalumi gwa Yuda.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Mfalumi Yehoshafati kanyawiti meli nkulu yazishemwa Talishishi za kugenda Ofiri kujega zahabu, Kumbiti zisoka ndiri toziya zimegekamegeka aku Esioni Geberi. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Na shaka ashi Ahazia mwana gwa Ahabu, kamgambira Yehoshafati, “Guwaleki wantumintumi waneni wagendi mwanja pamuhera na wantumintumi wa gwenga mumeli.” Kumbiti Yehoshafati kajimira ndiri mlandu agu.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Upeleru Yehoshafati kahowiti na kufindirwa mumasembi ga shifalumi mumji gwa Dawudi tati gwakuyi, na Yehoramu mwana gwakuyi, kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahaziya mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Mushinja sha kumi na saba sha ukolamlima wa Yehoshafati mfalumi gwa Yuda, Ahazia mwana gwa Ahabu, kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli. Kakolitimlima kwa vinja viwili, kulawa Samariya.<verse eid="1KI 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Ahazia katenditi madoda palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, kafatiti matendu ga tati gwakuyi na matendu ga mawu gwakuyi Yezebeli na ga mfalumi Yerobaamu mwana gwa Nebati, kawatenditi wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Kamgendiriti na kumguwira Baali, kamkalaziya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kwa kila mlandu ntambu yakatenditi tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>